window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b067-20d6a4be42786420.json"]={sha256:"20d6a4be4278642022937e7e869a302b7458dcac2c94ee8af40012b83f6953c3",value:{"id":"b067","title":"液態調諧阻尼器","titleEn":"Tuned liquid dampers","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從住宅與辦公塔樓的風致舒適度出發，用線性波浪理論決定淺水槽的晃動頻率與參與水量，用 U 形液柱公式設計液柱阻尼器，再處理閘門與阻尼網的振幅相依阻尼、屋頂水槽結構與分階段注水、以水深現場調頻、縮尺振動台試驗與完工監測，最後談蒸發補水、出水高度與交接，並以 Comcast Center、One Wall Centre 與 One Rincon Hill 的公開資料對照。","summaryEn":"Starting from wind comfort in residential and office towers, use linear wave theory to set the sloshing frequency and participating water of shallow tanks and the U-tube formula to size liquid-column dampers, then handle amplitude-dependent damping from gates and screens, rooftop tank structures and staged filling, field tuning by water depth, scaled shaking-table tests and post-completion monitoring, and finally evaporation, freeboard and handover, compared with public information on Comcast Center, One Wall Centre and One Rincon Hill.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-tall-systems","subcategoryTitle":"高層結構系統與減振","subcategoryTitleEn":"Tall-building structural systems and damping","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-tall-systems","learningTags":["structures","st-tall-systems","damper"],"architectureFamily":"damper","architectureNodes":[["建築第一模態","Building first mode"],["淺水槽與 U 形液柱","Shallow tanks and U-tube columns"],["阻尼網與閘門","Screens and gates"],["屋頂結構與防水","Roof structure and waterproofing"],["水位與補水系統","Level and make-up water system"],["監測與調頻紀錄","Monitoring and tuning records"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[1,3],[1,4],[4,5],[0,5]],"diagram":{"type":"damper","labels":["建築第一模態","淺水槽與 U 形液柱","阻尼網與閘門","屋頂結構與防水","水位與補水系統"],"labelsEn":["Building first mode","Shallow tanks and U-tube columns","Screens and gates","Roof structure and waterproofing","Level and make-up water system"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：某住宅塔樓第一模態 f₁ = 0.20 Hz、結構阻尼 1.5%、頂部廣義質量 M* = 30,000 t，目標有效質量比 μ = 1.5%，即 m_eff = 450 t。選用內淨長 L = 6.0 m、水深 h = 0.60 m 的淺水槽：ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L) = 5.137×0.304 ≈ 1.563 rad²/s²，f ≈ 0.199 Hz；第一晃動模態參與比例 8·tanh(πh/L)/(π³·h/L) = 8×0.304/3.10 ≈ 0.785，故總水量約 450/0.785 ≈ 573 t。每槽 6 m × 4 m × 0.60 m = 14.4 m³，40 槽共 576 m³。若加裝後總阻尼達 4.0%，均方根加速度約降為 √(1.5/4.0) ≈ 61%。若完工實測 f₁ 只有 0.185 Hz，水深須降到約 0.50 m，水量減為約 479 m³，有效質量比只剩約 1.26%，必須增至約 48 槽才能回到原目標。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實際建築的設計。","textEn":"Design exercise: a residential tower has f₁ = 0.20 Hz, 1.5% structural damping and a top generalised mass M* = 30,000 t, with a target effective mass ratio μ = 1.5%, so m_eff = 450 t. Choose shallow tanks with internal length L = 6.0 m and water depth h = 0.60 m: ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L) = 5.137×0.304 ≈ 1.563 rad²/s², so f ≈ 0.199 Hz; the first-mode participation ratio 8·tanh(πh/L)/(π³·h/L) = 8×0.304/3.10 ≈ 0.785, so the total water is about 450/0.785 ≈ 573 t. Each tank holds 6 m × 4 m × 0.60 m = 14.4 m³, and 40 tanks hold 576 m³. If total damping reaches 4.0% with the dampers, RMS acceleration falls to about √(1.5/4.0) ≈ 61%. If the completed building measures only 0.185 Hz, the depth must drop to about 0.50 m, the water to about 479 m³ and the effective mass ratio to about 1.26%, so about 48 tanks are needed to restore the target. Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of any real building.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b067-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型」與「線性波浪理論與晃動頻率」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper\" and \"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b067-v13-01","title":"風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「屋頂水槽群」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Rooftop tank array” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"液態調諧阻尼器（TLD）把水裝在頂部水槽中，讓水面晃動的第一模態頻率對準建築主模態；建築擺動時水的晃動落後約 90 度相位，水對槽壁的動壓力就成為與結構速度反向的控制力，碎波與阻尼網再把能量轉成熱。與鋼擺錘相比，它沒有軸承與吊索，造價低、維護簡單，水還能兼作消防或給水備用，但只有一部分水真正參與晃動，同樣效果需要較多總水量。住宅塔樓若風洞預測的頂層加速度超過舒適度門檻，水槽型阻尼器常比加厚核心筒便宜。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「屋頂水槽群」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A tuned liquid damper (TLD) holds water in rooftop tanks whose first sloshing frequency is tuned to the building's governing mode. As the tower sways the sloshing lags by roughly 90 degrees, so the dynamic water pressure on the tank walls becomes a control force opposing structural velocity, while wave breaking and damping screens turn energy into heat. Compared with a steel pendulum it has no bearings or hangers, costs less and is simpler to maintain, and the water can double as a fire or domestic reserve; however, only part of the water actually sloshes, so the same effect needs more total water. When wind-tunnel predictions put top-floor acceleration above the comfort threshold in a residential tower, a tank damper is often cheaper than thickening the core. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Rooftop tank array” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：所需有效質量 m_eff = μ·M*。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The required effective mass is m_eff = μ·M*.","failure":"常見誤解：「水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「屋頂水槽群」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Rooftop tank array”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-01-k1","title":"風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型","titleEn":"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper","text":"液態調諧阻尼器（TLD）把水裝在頂部水槽中，讓水面晃動的第一模態頻率對準建築主模態；建築擺動時水的晃動落後約 90 度相位，水對槽壁的動壓力就成為與結構速度反向的控制力，碎波與阻尼網再把能量轉成熱。與鋼擺錘相比，它沒有軸承與吊索，造價低、維護簡單，水還能兼作消防或給水備用，但只有一部分水真正參與晃動，同樣效果需要較多總水量。","textEn":"A tuned liquid damper (TLD) holds water in rooftop tanks whose first sloshing frequency is tuned to the building's governing mode. As the tower sways the sloshing lags by roughly 90 degrees, so the dynamic water pressure on the tank walls becomes a control force opposing structural velocity, while wave breaking and damping screens turn energy into heat.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper\" is correct?","options":["水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。","液態調諧阻尼器（TLD）把水裝在頂部水槽中，讓水面晃動的第一模態頻率對準建築主模態。","水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。"],"optionsEn":["All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass.","A tuned liquid damper (TLD) holds water in rooftop tanks whose first sloshing frequency is tuned to the building's governing mode.","The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"液態調諧阻尼器（TLD）把水裝在頂部水槽中，讓水面晃動的第一模態頻率對準建築主模態；建築擺動時水的晃動落後約 90 度相位，水對槽壁的動壓力就成為與結構速度反向的控制力，碎波與阻尼網再把能量轉成熱。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A tuned liquid damper (TLD) holds water in rooftop tanks whose first sloshing frequency is tuned to the building's governing mode. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b067-v13-02","title":"風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型：定量估算","titleEn":"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「屋頂水槽群」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Rooftop tank array” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：所需有效質量 m_eff = μ·M*。取第一模態廣義質量 M* = 30,000 t、目標質量比 μ = 1.5%，m_eff = 450 t；若淺水槽只有約 78.5% 的水參與第一晃動模態，總水量約 450/0.785 ≈ 573 t，約等於 573 m³ 的水。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The required effective mass is m_eff = μ·M*. With a first-mode generalised mass M* = 30,000 t and a target mass ratio μ = 1.5%, m_eff = 450 t; if only about 78.5% of the water in a shallow tank joins the first sloshing mode, the total water is about 450/0.785 ≈ 573 t, roughly 573 m³. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：要求風洞報告分別給出無阻尼器與加裝 TLD（以等效阻尼比表示）時，1 年與 10 年回歸期的頂層尖峰加速度，與 ISO 10137 或 AIJ 居住性曲線比較；同時由結構設計者確認屋頂樓板與轉換梁能承受水槽滿水加上晃動動壓的荷重組合。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Require the wind-tunnel report to give peak top-floor accelerations for 1-year and 10-year return periods both without a damper and with the TLD represented as equivalent damping, and compare them with ISO 10137 or AIJ habitability curves; the structural designer must also confirm that the roof slab and transfer beams carry full tanks plus sloshing pressure in the governing load combinations.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"所需有效質量 m_eff = μ·M*。取第一模態廣義質量 M* = 30,000 t、目標質量比 μ = 1.5%，m_eff = 450 t；若淺水槽只有約 78.5% 的水參與第一晃動模態，總水量約 450/0.785 ≈ 573 t，約等於 573 m³ 的水。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"The required effective mass is m_eff = μ·M*. With a first-mode generalised mass M* = 30,000 t and a target mass ratio μ = 1.5%, m_eff = 450 t; if only about 78.5% of the water in a shallow tank joins the first sloshing mode, the total water is about 450/0.785 ≈ 573 t, roughly 573 m³. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper\", which statement holds?","options":["液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。","液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。","所需有效質量 m_eff = μ·M*。"],"optionsEn":["A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude.","Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.","The required effective mass is m_eff = μ·M*."],"answer":2,"explanation":"所需有效質量 m_eff = μ·M*。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The required effective mass is m_eff = μ·M*. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b067-v13-03","title":"風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「屋頂水槽群」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Rooftop tank array” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"要求風洞報告分別給出無阻尼器與加裝 TLD（以等效阻尼比表示）時，1 年與 10 年回歸期的頂層尖峰加速度，與 ISO 10137 或 AIJ 居住性曲線比較；同時由結構設計者確認屋頂樓板與轉換梁能承受水槽滿水加上晃動動壓的荷重組合。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Require the wind-tunnel report to give peak top-floor accelerations for 1-year and 10-year return periods both without a damper and with the TLD represented as equivalent damping, and compare them with ISO 10137 or AIJ habitability curves; the structural designer must also confirm that the roof slab and transfer beams carry full tanks plus sloshing pressure in the governing load combinations. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：建築與機電要在概念設計就協調屋頂水槽的平面、高度與樓板加厚區；水槽兼作消防水源時，消防最低水位與調頻水位要在同一份圖說上分開標示。","observationEn":"Site practice: Architects and services engineers should coordinate tank footprint, height and thickened roof-slab zones at concept stage; when tanks double as fire-water storage, the fire minimum level and the tuning level must be marked separately on the same drawing.","failure":"注意干擾：若把整槽水量直接當成有效質量，會高估質量比約兩成，完工後加速度改善不如預期；水槽若放在模態位移較小的中層設備層，同樣水量的效果也會明顯打折。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating the full tank volume as effective mass overstates the mass ratio by about a fifth, so the acceleration improvement after completion falls short; placing tanks on a mid-height plant floor where modal displacement is smaller also sharply reduces the effect of the same water. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"要求風洞報告分別給出無阻尼器與加裝 TLD（以等效阻尼比表示）時，1 年與 10 年回歸期的頂層尖峰加速度，與 ISO 10137 或 AIJ 居住性曲線比較；同時由結構設計者確認屋頂樓板與轉換梁能承受水槽滿水加上晃動動壓的荷重組合。","textEn":"Require the wind-tunnel report to give peak top-floor accelerations for 1-year and 10-year return periods both without a damper and with the TLD represented as equivalent damping, and compare them with ISO 10137 or AIJ habitability curves; the structural designer must also confirm that the roof slab and transfer beams carry full tanks plus sloshing pressure in the governing load combinations.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"建築與機電要在概念設計就協調屋頂水槽的平面、高度與樓板加厚區；水槽兼作消防水源時，消防最低水位與調頻水位要在同一份圖說上分開標示。","textEn":"Architects and services engineers should coordinate tank footprint, height and thickened roof-slab zones at concept stage; when tanks double as fire-water storage, the fire minimum level and the tuning level must be marked separately on the same drawing.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper\"?","options":["要求風洞報告分別給出無阻尼器與加裝 TLD（以等效阻尼比表示）時，1 年與 10 年回歸期的頂層尖峰加速度，與 ISO 10137 或 AIJ 居住性曲線比較。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。"],"optionsEn":["Require the wind-tunnel report to give peak top-floor accelerations for 1-year and 10-year return periods both without a damper and with the TLD represented as equivalent damping, and compare them with ISO 10137 or AIJ habitability curves.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works."],"answer":0,"explanation":"要求風洞報告分別給出無阻尼器與加裝 TLD（以等效阻尼比表示）時，1 年與 10 年回歸期的頂層尖峰加速度，與 ISO 10137 或 AIJ 居住性曲線比較；同時由結構設計者確認屋頂樓板與轉換梁能承受水槽滿水加上晃動動壓的荷重組合。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Require the wind-tunnel report to give peak top-floor accelerations for 1-year and 10-year return periods both without a damper and with the TLD represented as equivalent damping, and compare them with ISO 10137 or AIJ habitability curves; the structural designer must also confirm that the roof slab and transfer beams carry full tanks plus sloshing pressure in the governing load combinations. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b067-v13-04","title":"風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型：失效診斷","titleEn":"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「屋頂水槽群」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Rooftop tank array” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把整槽水量直接當成有效質量，會高估質量比約兩成，完工後加速度改善不如預期；水槽若放在模態位移較小的中層設備層，同樣水量的效果也會明顯打折。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating the full tank volume as effective mass overstates the mass ratio by about a fifth, so the acceleration improvement after completion falls short; placing tanks on a mid-height plant floor where modal displacement is smaller also sharply reduces the effect of the same water. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：住宅塔樓若風洞預測的頂層加速度超過舒適度門檻，水槽型阻尼器常比加厚核心筒便宜。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: When wind-tunnel predictions put top-floor acceleration above the comfort threshold in a residential tower, a tank damper is often cheaper than thickening the core.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把整槽水量直接當成有效質量，會高估質量比約兩成，完工後加速度改善不如預期；水槽若放在模態位移較小的中層設備層，同樣水量的效果也會明顯打折。","textEn":"Treating the full tank volume as effective mass overstates the mass ratio by about a fifth, so the acceleration improvement after completion falls short; placing tanks on a mid-height plant floor where modal displacement is smaller also sharply reduces the effect of the same water.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「風致舒適度與液體阻尼器選型」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Wind comfort and choosing a liquid damper\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若把整槽水量直接當成有效質量，會高估質量比約兩成，完工後加速度改善不如預期；水槽若放在模態位移較小的中層設備層，同樣水量的效果也會明顯打折。","水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Treating the full tank volume as effective mass overstates the mass ratio by about a fifth, so the acceleration improvement after completion falls short.","The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若把整槽水量直接當成有效質量，會高估質量比約兩成，完工後加速度改善不如預期；水槽若放在模態位移較小的中層設備層，同樣水量的效果也會明顯打折。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating the full tank volume as effective mass overstates the mass ratio by about a fifth, so the acceleration improvement after completion falls short; placing tanks on a mid-height plant floor where modal displacement is smaller also sharply reduces the effect of the same water. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b067-v13-05","title":"線性波浪理論與晃動頻率：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「第一晃動模態」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “First sloshing mode” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"矩形水槽受水平擺動時，水會沿槽長方向形成駐波：第一模態是半個波長跨過整個槽長，水面一端升高、另一端下降。晃動頻率由運動方向的內淨長 L 與水深 h 決定，與槽寬及總水量無關；淺水時頻率大致與 √h/L 成正比。水深相對槽長很小的淺水槽在大振幅時會碎波，等效阻尼增加，但頻率也隨振幅略為升高（硬化），所以 TLD 是非線性阻尼器，必須先定義設計振幅。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「第一晃動模態」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When a rectangular tank is moved horizontally, the water forms a standing wave along the tank: in the first mode half a wavelength spans the tank length, with the surface rising at one end and falling at the other. The sloshing frequency depends on the internal length L in the direction of motion and the water depth h, not on tank width or total volume; in shallow water it is roughly proportional to √h/L. Shallow tanks break waves at large amplitude, which adds equivalent damping but also raises the frequency slightly (hardening), so a TLD is a nonlinear damper and its design amplitude must be defined first. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “First sloshing mode” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：線性波浪理論 ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Linear wave theory gives ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L).","failure":"常見誤解：「水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「第一晃動模態」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “First sloshing mode”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-05-k1","title":"線性波浪理論與晃動頻率","titleEn":"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency","text":"矩形水槽受水平擺動時，水會沿槽長方向形成駐波：第一模態是半個波長跨過整個槽長，水面一端升高、另一端下降。晃動頻率由運動方向的內淨長 L 與水深 h 決定，與槽寬及總水量無關；淺水時頻率大致與 √h/L 成正比。","textEn":"When a rectangular tank is moved horizontally, the water forms a standing wave along the tank: in the first mode half a wavelength spans the tank length, with the surface rising at one end and falling at the other. The sloshing frequency depends on the internal length L in the direction of motion and the water depth h, not on tank width or total volume; in shallow water it is roughly proportional to √h/L.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「線性波浪理論與晃動頻率」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency\" is correct?","options":["水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。","U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。","矩形水槽受水平擺動時，水會沿槽長方向形成駐波：第一模態是半個波長跨過整個槽長，水面一端升高、另一端下降。"],"optionsEn":["The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency.","The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.","When a rectangular tank is moved horizontally, the water forms a standing wave along the tank: in the first mode half a wavelength spans the tank length, with the surface rising at one end and falling at the other."],"answer":2,"explanation":"矩形水槽受水平擺動時，水會沿槽長方向形成駐波：第一模態是半個波長跨過整個槽長，水面一端升高、另一端下降。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When a rectangular tank is moved horizontally, the water forms a standing wave along the tank: in the first mode half a wavelength spans the tank length, with the surface rising at one end and falling at the other. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b067-v13-06","title":"線性波浪理論與晃動頻率：定量估算","titleEn":"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「第一晃動模態」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “First sloshing mode” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：線性波浪理論 ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L)。取 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m：πh/L = 0.314，tanh = 0.304，ω² = 5.137×0.304 ≈ 1.563 rad²/s²，ω ≈ 1.250 rad/s，f = ω/2π ≈ 0.199 Hz，可對準 0.20 Hz 的建築模態；若槽長改為 8 m 而水深比不變，f 降為約 0.172 Hz。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Linear wave theory gives ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L). With L = 6.0 m and h = 0.60 m: πh/L = 0.314, tanh = 0.304, ω² = 5.137×0.304 ≈ 1.563 rad²/s², ω ≈ 1.250 rad/s and f = ω/2π ≈ 0.199 Hz, matching a 0.20 Hz building mode; an 8 m tank with the same depth ratio drops to about 0.172 Hz. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：製作單槽樣品放在振動台上做正弦掃頻，以水位計量測槽端波高，找出共振頻率並與公式比較；再以不同振幅重複掃頻，記錄頻率隨振幅升高的幅度與開始碎波的振幅，作為選擇設計振幅的依據。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Put a single prototype tank on a shaking table and run sinusoidal sweeps, measuring wave height at the tank ends with level gauges, find the resonant frequency and compare it with the formula; repeat at several amplitudes and record how much the frequency rises with amplitude and where wave breaking starts, as the basis for choosing the design amplitude.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"線性波浪理論 ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L)。取 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m：πh/L = 0.314，tanh = 0.304，ω² = 5.137×0.304 ≈ 1.563 rad²/s²，ω ≈ 1.250 rad/s，f = ω/2π ≈ 0.199 Hz，可對準 0.20 Hz 的建築模態；若槽長改為 8 m 而水深比不變，f 降為約 0.172 Hz。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Linear wave theory gives ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L). With L = 6.0 m and h = 0.60 m: πh/L = 0.314, tanh = 0.304, ω² = 5.137×0.304 ≈ 1.563 rad²/s², ω ≈ 1.250 rad/s and f = ω/2π ≈ 0.199 Hz, matching a 0.20 Hz building mode; an 8 m tank with the same depth ratio drops to about 0.172 Hz. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「線性波浪理論與晃動頻率」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency\", which statement holds?","options":["線性波浪理論 ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L)。","水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。","縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。"],"optionsEn":["Linear wave theory gives ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L).","A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member.","A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions."],"answer":0,"explanation":"線性波浪理論 ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Linear wave theory gives ω² = (πg/L)·tanh(πh/L). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b067-v13-07","title":"線性波浪理論與晃動頻率：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「第一晃動模態」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “First sloshing mode” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"製作單槽樣品放在振動台上做正弦掃頻，以水位計量測槽端波高，找出共振頻率並與公式比較；再以不同振幅重複掃頻，記錄頻率隨振幅升高的幅度與開始碎波的振幅，作為選擇設計振幅的依據。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Put a single prototype tank on a shaking table and run sinusoidal sweeps, measuring wave height at the tank ends with level gauges, find the resonant frequency and compare it with the formula; repeat at several amplitudes and record how much the frequency rises with amplitude and where wave breaking starts, as the basis for choosing the design amplitude. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：圖說上應標明每個水槽的內淨長、設計水深與允許偏差（例如水深 ±5 mm），並規定槽內不得穿越管線或增設構件；需要雙向減振時，用正方形或兩向長度不同的水槽分別對準兩個方向的頻率。","observationEn":"Site practice: Drawings should state each tank's internal length, design water depth and tolerance (for example ±5 mm on depth), and forbid pipes or members inside the tank; where both directions need control, use square tanks or tanks with different lengths in the two directions to match each direction's frequency.","failure":"注意干擾：若以小振幅線性頻率調頻，但設計風速下的振幅讓水槽進入碎波狀態，水槽頻率升高而與建築脫調，減振效果反而在最需要時下降；槽內若有未計入的柱、管線或隔板，也會改變有效槽長與頻率。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Tuning to the small-amplitude linear frequency while the design-wind amplitude drives the tank into wave breaking raises the tank frequency and detunes it from the building, so performance drops exactly when it is needed; columns, pipes or partitions inside the tank that were not modelled also change the effective length and frequency. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"製作單槽樣品放在振動台上做正弦掃頻，以水位計量測槽端波高，找出共振頻率並與公式比較；再以不同振幅重複掃頻，記錄頻率隨振幅升高的幅度與開始碎波的振幅，作為選擇設計振幅的依據。","textEn":"Put a single prototype tank on a shaking table and run sinusoidal sweeps, measuring wave height at the tank ends with level gauges, find the resonant frequency and compare it with the formula; repeat at several amplitudes and record how much the frequency rises with amplitude and where wave breaking starts, as the basis for choosing the design amplitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"圖說上應標明每個水槽的內淨長、設計水深與允許偏差（例如水深 ±5 mm），並規定槽內不得穿越管線或增設構件；需要雙向減振時，用正方形或兩向長度不同的水槽分別對準兩個方向的頻率。","textEn":"Drawings should state each tank's internal length, design water depth and tolerance (for example ±5 mm on depth), and forbid pipes or members inside the tank; where both directions need control, use square tanks or tanks with different lengths in the two directions to match each direction's frequency.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「線性波浪理論與晃動頻率」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","製作單槽樣品放在振動台上做正弦掃頻，以水位計量測槽端波高，找出共振頻率並與公式比較。","水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Put a single prototype tank on a shaking table and run sinusoidal sweeps, measuring wave height at the tank ends with level gauges, find the resonant frequency and compare it with the formula.","As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change."],"answer":1,"explanation":"製作單槽樣品放在振動台上做正弦掃頻，以水位計量測槽端波高，找出共振頻率並與公式比較；再以不同振幅重複掃頻，記錄頻率隨振幅升高的幅度與開始碎波的振幅，作為選擇設計振幅的依據。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Put a single prototype tank on a shaking table and run sinusoidal sweeps, measuring wave height at the tank ends with level gauges, find the resonant frequency and compare it with the formula; repeat at several amplitudes and record how much the frequency rises with amplitude and where wave breaking starts, as the basis for choosing the design amplitude. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b067-v13-08","title":"線性波浪理論與晃動頻率：失效診斷","titleEn":"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「第一晃動模態」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “First sloshing mode” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若以小振幅線性頻率調頻，但設計風速下的振幅讓水槽進入碎波狀態，水槽頻率升高而與建築脫調，減振效果反而在最需要時下降；槽內若有未計入的柱、管線或隔板，也會改變有效槽長與頻率。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Tuning to the small-amplitude linear frequency while the design-wind amplitude drives the tank into wave breaking raises the tank frequency and detunes it from the building, so performance drops exactly when it is needed; columns, pipes or partitions inside the tank that were not modelled also change the effective length and frequency. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：水深相對槽長很小的淺水槽在大振幅時會碎波，等效阻尼增加，但頻率也隨振幅略為升高（硬化），所以 TLD 是非線性阻尼器，必須先定義設計振幅。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Shallow tanks break waves at large amplitude, which adds equivalent damping but also raises the frequency slightly (hardening), so a TLD is a nonlinear damper and its design amplitude must be defined first.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若以小振幅線性頻率調頻，但設計風速下的振幅讓水槽進入碎波狀態，水槽頻率升高而與建築脫調，減振效果反而在最需要時下降；槽內若有未計入的柱、管線或隔板，也會改變有效槽長與頻率。","textEn":"Tuning to the small-amplitude linear frequency while the design-wind amplitude drives the tank into wave breaking raises the tank frequency and detunes it from the building, so performance drops exactly when it is needed; columns, pipes or partitions inside the tank that were not modelled also change the effective length and frequency.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「線性波浪理論與晃動頻率」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Linear wave theory and sloshing frequency\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。","若以小振幅線性頻率調頻，但設計風速下的振幅讓水槽進入碎波狀態，水槽頻率升高而與建築脫調，減振效果反而在最需要時下降。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.","Tuning to the small-amplitude linear frequency while the design-wind amplitude drives the tank into wave breaking raises the tank frequency and detunes it from the building, so performance drops exactly when it is needed."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若以小振幅線性頻率調頻，但設計風速下的振幅讓水槽進入碎波狀態，水槽頻率升高而與建築脫調，減振效果反而在最需要時下降；槽內若有未計入的柱、管線或隔板，也會改變有效槽長與頻率。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Tuning to the small-amplitude linear frequency while the design-wind amplitude drives the tank into wave breaking raises the tank frequency and detunes it from the building, so performance drops exactly when it is needed; columns, pipes or partitions inside the tank that were not modelled also change the effective length and frequency. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b067-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻」與「水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning\" and \"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b067-v13-09","title":"液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「U 形液柱」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “U-shaped liquid column” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"液柱阻尼器（TLCD）把水放在 U 形管路中：底部水平段的水隨建築擺動被推向一側，兩端垂直段水位一升一降，由重力提供回復力，就像以水為質量的擺。它的頻率只取決於液柱總長，且整段水都參與運動，比淺水晃動容易建立數學模型；控制力來自水平段水的加速度，所以水平段占總長的比例 α 越大，等效質量越有效。費城 Comcast Center 與溫哥華 One Wall Centre 都以大型液柱阻尼器處理風致舒適度。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「U 形液柱」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A tuned liquid column damper (TLCD) holds water in a U-shaped conduit: as the building sways the water in the horizontal leg is pushed to one side and the levels in the two vertical legs rise and fall, with gravity supplying the restoring force like a pendulum whose mass is water. Its frequency depends only on the total column length, and the whole column moves, so it is easier to model than shallow sloshing; the control force comes from accelerating the water in the horizontal leg, so the larger the horizontal length ratio α, the more effective the mass. Comcast Center in Philadelphia and One Wall Centre in Vancouver both use large liquid-column dampers for wind comfort. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “U-shaped liquid column” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L)，故 L = 2g/(2πf)²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L), so L = 2g/(2πf)².","failure":"常見誤解：「U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「U 形液柱」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “U-shaped liquid column”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-09-k1","title":"液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻","titleEn":"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning","text":"液柱阻尼器（TLCD）把水放在 U 形管路中：底部水平段的水隨建築擺動被推向一側，兩端垂直段水位一升一降，由重力提供回復力，就像以水為質量的擺。它的頻率只取決於液柱總長，且整段水都參與運動，比淺水晃動容易建立數學模型；控制力來自水平段水的加速度，所以水平段占總長的比例 α 越大，等效質量越有效。","textEn":"A tuned liquid column damper (TLCD) holds water in a U-shaped conduit: as the building sways the water in the horizontal leg is pushed to one side and the levels in the two vertical legs rise and fall, with gravity supplying the restoring force like a pendulum whose mass is water. Its frequency depends only on the total column length, and the whole column moves, so it is easier to model than shallow sloshing; the control force comes from accelerating the water in the horizontal leg, so the larger the horizontal length ratio α, the more effective the mass.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning\" is correct?","options":["液柱阻尼器（TLCD）把水放在 U 形管路中：底部水平段的水隨建築擺動被推向一側，兩端垂直段水位一升一降，由重力提供回復力，就像以水為質量的擺。","U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。","液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。"],"optionsEn":["A tuned liquid column damper (TLCD) holds water in a U-shaped conduit: as the building sways the water in the horizontal leg is pushed to one side and the levels in the two vertical legs rise and fall, with gravity supplying the restoring force like a pendulum whose mass is water.","The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.","A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude."],"answer":0,"explanation":"液柱阻尼器（TLCD）把水放在 U 形管路中：底部水平段的水隨建築擺動被推向一側，兩端垂直段水位一升一降，由重力提供回復力，就像以水為質量的擺。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A tuned liquid column damper (TLCD) holds water in a U-shaped conduit: as the building sways the water in the horizontal leg is pushed to one side and the levels in the two vertical legs rise and fall, with gravity supplying the restoring force like a pendulum whose mass is water. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b067-v13-10","title":"液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻：定量估算","titleEn":"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「U 形液柱」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “U-shaped liquid column” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L)，故 L = 2g/(2πf)²。f = 0.16 Hz 時 L = 19.62/1.011 ≈ 19.4 m；取水平段比例 α = 0.65，水平段約 12.6 m，兩端垂直段各約 3.4 m。斷面積 10 m² 時水量約 194 t，耦合有效質量約 α²×194 ≈ 82 t。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L), so L = 2g/(2πf)². For f = 0.16 Hz, L = 19.62/1.011 ≈ 19.4 m; with a horizontal length ratio α = 0.65 the horizontal leg is about 12.6 m and each vertical leg about 3.4 m. With a 10 m² cross-section the water is about 194 t, and the effectively coupled mass is about α²×194 ≈ 82 t. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：施工後先在靜止狀態確認兩端水位相同並複核液柱總長，再以短暫操作閘門造成水位差後釋放，量測垂直段水位的自由振盪週期，換算頻率與設計值比較；斷面有變化時，以等效長度公式重算後再比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After construction, confirm at rest that the two end levels match and re-check the total column length, then create a level difference by briefly operating the gate and release it, measure the free-oscillation period of the vertical legs, and compare the derived frequency with design; where the cross-section varies, recompute with an equivalent-length formula before comparing.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L)，故 L = 2g/(2πf)²。f = 0.16 Hz 時 L = 19.62/1.011 ≈ 19.4 m；取水平段比例 α = 0.65，水平段約 12.6 m，兩端垂直段各約 3.4 m。斷面積 10 m² 時水量約 194 t，耦合有效質量約 α²×194 ≈ 82 t。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L), so L = 2g/(2πf)². For f = 0.16 Hz, L = 19.62/1.011 ≈ 19.4 m; with a horizontal length ratio α = 0.65 the horizontal leg is about 12.6 m and each vertical leg about 3.4 m. With a 10 m² cross-section the water is about 194 t, and the effectively coupled mass is about α²×194 ≈ 82 t. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning\", which statement holds?","options":["液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。","f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L)，故 L = 2g/(2πf)²。","只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。"],"optionsEn":["Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.","f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L), so L = 2g/(2πf)².","A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works."],"answer":1,"explanation":"f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L)，故 L = 2g/(2πf)²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"f = (1/2π)·√(2g/L), so L = 2g/(2πf)². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b067-v13-11","title":"液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「U 形液柱」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “U-shaped liquid column” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"施工後先在靜止狀態確認兩端水位相同並複核液柱總長，再以短暫操作閘門造成水位差後釋放，量測垂直段水位的自由振盪週期，換算頻率與設計值比較；斷面有變化時，以等效長度公式重算後再比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After construction, confirm at rest that the two end levels match and re-check the total column length, then create a level difference by briefly operating the gate and release it, measure the free-oscillation period of the vertical legs, and compare the derived frequency with design; where the cross-section varies, recompute with an equivalent-length formula before comparing. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：液柱總長、各段斷面變化與通氣口位置要在結構與機電圖上同時標示；垂直段頂部應保留至少等於設計振幅加安全餘裕的淨高，閘門須設在可檢修的位置。","observationEn":"Site practice: Total column length, cross-section changes and vent locations must appear on both structural and services drawings; leave headroom above each vertical leg at least equal to the design amplitude plus a safety margin, and place the gate where it can be serviced.","failure":"注意干擾：若垂直段頂部淨高不足，大振幅時水柱衝出或把空氣壓入水平段，液柱有效長度改變並產生衝擊噪音；兩端若以密閉蓋板封住而未通氣，被壓縮的空氣會變成額外彈簧，把頻率推高而脫調。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If headroom above the vertical legs is insufficient, large amplitudes eject water or drive air into the horizontal leg, changing the effective column length and causing impact noise; sealing the leg tops without venting turns trapped air into an extra spring that pushes the frequency up and detunes the damper. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"施工後先在靜止狀態確認兩端水位相同並複核液柱總長，再以短暫操作閘門造成水位差後釋放，量測垂直段水位的自由振盪週期，換算頻率與設計值比較；斷面有變化時，以等效長度公式重算後再比較。","textEn":"After construction, confirm at rest that the two end levels match and re-check the total column length, then create a level difference by briefly operating the gate and release it, measure the free-oscillation period of the vertical legs, and compare the derived frequency with design; where the cross-section varies, recompute with an equivalent-length formula before comparing.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"液柱總長、各段斷面變化與通氣口位置要在結構與機電圖上同時標示；垂直段頂部應保留至少等於設計振幅加安全餘裕的淨高，閘門須設在可檢修的位置。","textEn":"Total column length, cross-section changes and vent locations must appear on both structural and services drawings; leave headroom above each vertical leg at least equal to the design amplitude plus a safety margin, and place the gate where it can be serviced.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。","施工後先在靜止狀態確認兩端水位相同並複核液柱總長，再以短暫操作閘門造成水位差後釋放，量測垂直段水位的自由振盪週期，換算頻率與設計值比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake.","After construction, confirm at rest that the two end levels match and re-check the total column length, then create a level difference by briefly operating the gate and release it, measure the free-oscillation period of the vertical legs, and compare the derived frequency with design."],"answer":2,"explanation":"施工後先在靜止狀態確認兩端水位相同並複核液柱總長，再以短暫操作閘門造成水位差後釋放，量測垂直段水位的自由振盪週期，換算頻率與設計值比較；斷面有變化時，以等效長度公式重算後再比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"After construction, confirm at rest that the two end levels match and re-check the total column length, then create a level difference by briefly operating the gate and release it, measure the free-oscillation period of the vertical legs, and compare the derived frequency with design; where the cross-section varies, recompute with an equivalent-length formula before comparing. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b067-v13-12","title":"液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻：失效診斷","titleEn":"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「U 形液柱」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “U-shaped liquid column” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若垂直段頂部淨高不足，大振幅時水柱衝出或把空氣壓入水平段，液柱有效長度改變並產生衝擊噪音；兩端若以密閉蓋板封住而未通氣，被壓縮的空氣會變成額外彈簧，把頻率推高而脫調。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If headroom above the vertical legs is insufficient, large amplitudes eject water or drive air into the horizontal leg, changing the effective column length and causing impact noise; sealing the leg tops without venting turns trapped air into an extra spring that pushes the frequency up and detunes the damper. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：費城 Comcast Center 與溫哥華 One Wall Centre 都以大型液柱阻尼器處理風致舒適度。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Comcast Center in Philadelphia and One Wall Centre in Vancouver both use large liquid-column dampers for wind comfort.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若垂直段頂部淨高不足，大振幅時水柱衝出或把空氣壓入水平段，液柱有效長度改變並產生衝擊噪音；兩端若以密閉蓋板封住而未通氣，被壓縮的空氣會變成額外彈簧，把頻率推高而脫調。","textEn":"If headroom above the vertical legs is insufficient, large amplitudes eject water or drive air into the horizontal leg, changing the effective column length and causing impact noise; sealing the leg tops without venting turns trapped air into an extra spring that pushes the frequency up and detunes the damper.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「液柱阻尼器的幾何與調頻」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Liquid-column damper geometry and tuning\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["若垂直段頂部淨高不足，大振幅時水柱衝出或把空氣壓入水平段，液柱有效長度改變並產生衝擊噪音。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。"],"optionsEn":["If headroom above the vertical legs is insufficient, large amplitudes eject water or drive air into the horizontal leg, changing the effective column length and causing impact noise.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若垂直段頂部淨高不足，大振幅時水柱衝出或把空氣壓入水平段，液柱有效長度改變並產生衝擊噪音；兩端若以密閉蓋板封住而未通氣，被壓縮的空氣會變成額外彈簧，把頻率推高而脫調。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If headroom above the vertical legs is insufficient, large amplitudes eject water or drive air into the horizontal leg, changing the effective column length and causing impact noise; sealing the leg tops without venting turns trapped air into an extra spring that pushes the frequency up and detunes the damper. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b067-v13-13","title":"水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「阻尼網與閘門孔口」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Damping screens and gate orifice” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"液體阻尼器的耗能來自水流經孔口、閘門或阻尼網時的紊流水頭損失，損失與流速平方成正比，因此等效阻尼隨振幅增大而增加，不像線性黏滯阻尼是固定值。淺水槽則靠碎波與槽內垂直阻尼網或擋板耗能，阻尼網的開孔率決定損失係數。設計者必須選定代表性振幅（通常是設計回歸期風況下的振幅），讓該處的等效阻尼接近最佳值，並接受其他振幅下偏離最佳。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「阻尼網與閘門孔口」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Dissipation in a liquid damper comes from turbulent head loss as water passes orifices, gates or damping screens; the loss is proportional to velocity squared, so equivalent damping grows with amplitude instead of staying fixed as in a linear viscous damper. Shallow tanks rely on wave breaking and on vertical screens or baffles, whose open-area ratio sets the loss coefficient. The designer must choose a representative amplitude, usually the one in the design-return-period wind, at which equivalent damping is near optimum, and accept departures from the optimum at other amplitudes. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Damping screens and gate orifice” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以等效線性化，ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: By equivalent linearisation, ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L).","failure":"常見誤解：「液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「阻尼網與閘門孔口」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Damping screens and gate orifice”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-13-k1","title":"水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼","titleEn":"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping","text":"液體阻尼器的耗能來自水流經孔口、閘門或阻尼網時的紊流水頭損失，損失與流速平方成正比，因此等效阻尼隨振幅增大而增加，不像線性黏滯阻尼是固定值。淺水槽則靠碎波與槽內垂直阻尼網或擋板耗能，阻尼網的開孔率決定損失係數。","textEn":"Dissipation in a liquid damper comes from turbulent head loss as water passes orifices, gates or damping screens; the loss is proportional to velocity squared, so equivalent damping grows with amplitude instead of staying fixed as in a linear viscous damper. Shallow tanks rely on wave breaking and on vertical screens or baffles, whose open-area ratio sets the loss coefficient.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping\" is correct?","options":["液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。","液體阻尼器的耗能來自水流經孔口、閘門或阻尼網時的紊流水頭損失，損失與流速平方成正比，因此等效阻尼隨振幅增大而增加，不像線性黏滯阻尼是固定值。","水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。"],"optionsEn":["A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude.","Dissipation in a liquid damper comes from turbulent head loss as water passes orifices, gates or damping screens.","A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member."],"answer":1,"explanation":"液體阻尼器的耗能來自水流經孔口、閘門或阻尼網時的紊流水頭損失，損失與流速平方成正比，因此等效阻尼隨振幅增大而增加，不像線性黏滯阻尼是固定值。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Dissipation in a liquid damper comes from turbulent head loss as water passes orifices, gates or damping screens; the loss is proportional to velocity squared, so equivalent damping grows with amplitude instead of staying fixed as in a linear viscous damper. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b067-v13-14","title":"水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼：定量估算","titleEn":"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「阻尼網與閘門孔口」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Damping screens and gate orifice” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以等效線性化，ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L)。取 L = 19.4 m、水頭損失係數 ξ = 15：液柱振幅 u₀ = 0.50 m 時 ζ_eq = 15/182.9 ≈ 8.2%；u₀ = 0.15 m 時只有約 2.5%。調整閘門開度改變 ξ，就能把最佳阻尼移到另一個設計振幅。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: By equivalent linearisation, ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L). With L = 19.4 m and head-loss coefficient ξ = 15, a column amplitude u₀ = 0.50 m gives ζ_eq = 15/182.9 ≈ 8.2%, while u₀ = 0.15 m gives only about 2.5%. Changing the gate opening alters ξ and moves the optimum damping to another design amplitude. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以振動台試驗量測不同振幅下的水位或晃動力時間歷程，計算每循環耗能並換算等效阻尼比，畫出阻尼—振幅曲線；閘門開度與阻尼網開孔率逐檔試驗，確認設計振幅處的等效阻尼落在最佳值的允許範圍內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: On a shaking table record level or sloshing-force histories at several amplitudes, compute energy dissipated per cycle and convert it to an equivalent damping ratio to plot damping against amplitude; test each gate setting and screen open-area ratio to confirm that equivalent damping at the design amplitude lies within the allowed band around the optimum.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以等效線性化，ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L)。取 L = 19.4 m、水頭損失係數 ξ = 15：液柱振幅 u₀ = 0.50 m 時 ζ_eq = 15/182.9 ≈ 8.2%；u₀ = 0.15 m 時只有約 2.5%。調整閘門開度改變 ξ，就能把最佳阻尼移到另一個設計振幅。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"By equivalent linearisation, ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L). With L = 19.4 m and head-loss coefficient ξ = 15, a column amplitude u₀ = 0.50 m gives ζ_eq = 15/182.9 ≈ 8.2%, while u₀ = 0.15 m gives only about 2.5%. Changing the gate opening alters ξ and moves the optimum damping to another design amplitude. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping\", which statement holds?","options":["縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。","水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。","以等效線性化，ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L)。"],"optionsEn":["A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions.","As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.","By equivalent linearisation, ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以等效線性化，ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"By equivalent linearisation, ζ_eq = 2ξ·u₀/(3π·L). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b067-v13-15","title":"水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「阻尼網與閘門孔口」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Damping screens and gate orifice” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以振動台試驗量測不同振幅下的水位或晃動力時間歷程，計算每循環耗能並換算等效阻尼比，畫出阻尼—振幅曲線；閘門開度與阻尼網開孔率逐檔試驗，確認設計振幅處的等效阻尼落在最佳值的允許範圍內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"On a shaking table record level or sloshing-force histories at several amplitudes, compute energy dissipated per cycle and convert it to an equivalent damping ratio to plot damping against amplitude; test each gate setting and screen open-area ratio to confirm that equivalent damping at the design amplitude lies within the allowed band around the optimum. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：規範應寫明設計振幅、該振幅下的目標等效阻尼與閘門或阻尼網的可調範圍；阻尼網採不鏽鋼等耐蝕材料並設計成可拆卸清洗，閘門開度須有鎖定裝置並記錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: The specification should state the design amplitude, the target equivalent damping at that amplitude and the adjustable range of gates or screens; screens should be stainless steel or another corrosion-resistant material and removable for cleaning, and gate settings must be lockable and recorded.","failure":"注意干擾：阻尼網開孔率太小時，水在小振幅就被鎖住，液體近似附加質量，日常強風幾乎沒有效果；開孔太大則大振幅時阻尼不足，水面振幅超過預留淨高而撞擊槽頂。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Screens with too little open area lock the water at small amplitudes so it acts almost as added mass and does little in ordinary strong winds; too much open area leaves too little damping at large amplitude, so the surface excursion exceeds the freeboard and strikes the tank roof. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以振動台試驗量測不同振幅下的水位或晃動力時間歷程，計算每循環耗能並換算等效阻尼比，畫出阻尼—振幅曲線；閘門開度與阻尼網開孔率逐檔試驗，確認設計振幅處的等效阻尼落在最佳值的允許範圍內。","textEn":"On a shaking table record level or sloshing-force histories at several amplitudes, compute energy dissipated per cycle and convert it to an equivalent damping ratio to plot damping against amplitude; test each gate setting and screen open-area ratio to confirm that equivalent damping at the design amplitude lies within the allowed band around the optimum.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"規範應寫明設計振幅、該振幅下的目標等效阻尼與閘門或阻尼網的可調範圍；阻尼網採不鏽鋼等耐蝕材料並設計成可拆卸清洗，閘門開度須有鎖定裝置並記錄。","textEn":"The specification should state the design amplitude, the target equivalent damping at that amplitude and the adjustable range of gates or screens; screens should be stainless steel or another corrosion-resistant material and removable for cleaning, and gate settings must be lockable and recorded.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping\"?","options":["以振動台試驗量測不同振幅下的水位或晃動力時間歷程，計算每循環耗能並換算等效阻尼比，畫出阻尼—振幅曲線。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。"],"optionsEn":["On a shaking table record level or sloshing-force histories at several amplitudes, compute energy dissipated per cycle and convert it to an equivalent damping ratio to plot damping against amplitude.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以振動台試驗量測不同振幅下的水位或晃動力時間歷程，計算每循環耗能並換算等效阻尼比，畫出阻尼—振幅曲線；閘門開度與阻尼網開孔率逐檔試驗，確認設計振幅處的等效阻尼落在最佳值的允許範圍內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"On a shaking table record level or sloshing-force histories at several amplitudes, compute energy dissipated per cycle and convert it to an equivalent damping ratio to plot damping against amplitude; test each gate setting and screen open-area ratio to confirm that equivalent damping at the design amplitude lies within the allowed band around the optimum. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b067-v13-16","title":"水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼：失效診斷","titleEn":"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「阻尼網與閘門孔口」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Damping screens and gate orifice” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"阻尼網開孔率太小時，水在小振幅就被鎖住，液體近似附加質量，日常強風幾乎沒有效果；開孔太大則大振幅時阻尼不足，水面振幅超過預留淨高而撞擊槽頂。阻尼網鏽蝕或被沉積物堵塞，也會在不知不覺中改變損失係數。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Screens with too little open area lock the water at small amplitudes so it acts almost as added mass and does little in ordinary strong winds; too much open area leaves too little damping at large amplitude, so the surface excursion exceeds the freeboard and strikes the tank roof. Corroded or clogged screens silently change the loss coefficient as well. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：設計者必須選定代表性振幅（通常是設計回歸期風況下的振幅），讓該處的等效阻尼接近最佳值，並接受其他振幅下偏離最佳。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The designer must choose a representative amplitude, usually the one in the design-return-period wind, at which equivalent damping is near optimum, and accept departures from the optimum at other amplitudes.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"阻尼網開孔率太小時，水在小振幅就被鎖住，液體近似附加質量，日常強風幾乎沒有效果；開孔太大則大振幅時阻尼不足，水面振幅超過預留淨高而撞擊槽頂。阻尼網鏽蝕或被沉積物堵塞，也會在不知不覺中改變損失係數。","textEn":"Screens with too little open area lock the water at small amplitudes so it acts almost as added mass and does little in ordinary strong winds; too much open area leaves too little damping at large amplitude, so the surface excursion exceeds the freeboard and strikes the tank roof. Corroded or clogged screens silently change the loss coefficient as well.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水頭損失與振幅相依阻尼」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Head loss and amplitude-dependent damping\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","阻尼網開孔率太小時，水在小振幅就被鎖住，液體近似附加質量，日常強風幾乎沒有效果；開孔太大則大振幅時阻尼不足，水面振幅超過預留淨高而撞擊槽頂。","水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Screens with too little open area lock the water at small amplitudes so it acts almost as added mass and does little in ordinary strong winds.","A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member."],"answer":1,"explanation":"阻尼網開孔率太小時，水在小振幅就被鎖住，液體近似附加質量，日常強風幾乎沒有效果；開孔太大則大振幅時阻尼不足，水面振幅超過預留淨高而撞擊槽頂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Screens with too little open area lock the water at small amplitudes so it acts almost as added mass and does little in ordinary strong winds; too much open area leaves too little damping at large amplitude, so the surface excursion exceeds the freeboard and strikes the tank roof. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b067-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「水槽結構、防水與分階段注水」與「實測建築頻率與現場調頻」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling\" and \"Measured building frequency and field tuning\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b067-v13-17","title":"水槽結構、防水與分階段注水：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「水槽結構與防水層」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tank structure and waterproofing” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"數百公噸的水集中在屋頂，水槽本身就是承受靜水壓與晃動動壓的結構：混凝土水槽須控制裂縫寬度並加防水內襯，鋼或玻璃纖維水槽則要處理接縫與防蝕。滿水重量經槽底樓板、梁與柱傳到核心筒，屋頂樓板常需加厚或增設轉換梁。注水必須分階段進行，一方面確認樓板撓度與滲漏，一方面在每個水位量測頻率，逐步逼近調頻水位。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「水槽結構與防水層」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Several hundred tonnes of water concentrated on the roof make each tank a structure that resists hydrostatic and sloshing pressure: concrete tanks need crack-width control and a waterproof liner, while steel or glass-fibre tanks need attention to joints and corrosion protection. The full weight travels through the tank floor, beams and columns to the core, so roof slabs are often thickened or given transfer beams. Filling is done in stages, both to check slab deflection and leakage and to measure frequency at each level while approaching the tuning depth. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Tank structure and waterproofing” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：靜水壓 p = ρgh。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Hydrostatic pressure p = ρgh.","failure":"常見誤解：「水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「水槽結構與防水層」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Tank structure and waterproofing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-17-k1","title":"水槽結構、防水與分階段注水","titleEn":"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling","text":"數百公噸的水集中在屋頂，水槽本身就是承受靜水壓與晃動動壓的結構：混凝土水槽須控制裂縫寬度並加防水內襯，鋼或玻璃纖維水槽則要處理接縫與防蝕。滿水重量經槽底樓板、梁與柱傳到核心筒，屋頂樓板常需加厚或增設轉換梁。","textEn":"Several hundred tonnes of water concentrated on the roof make each tank a structure that resists hydrostatic and sloshing pressure: concrete tanks need crack-width control and a waterproof liner, while steel or glass-fibre tanks need attention to joints and corrosion protection. The full weight travels through the tank floor, beams and columns to the core, so roof slabs are often thickened or given transfer beams.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水槽結構、防水與分階段注水」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling\" is correct?","options":["水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。","液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。","數百公噸的水集中在屋頂，水槽本身就是承受靜水壓與晃動動壓的結構：混凝土水槽須控制裂縫寬度並加防水內襯，鋼或玻璃纖維水槽則要處理接縫與防蝕。"],"optionsEn":["A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member.","Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.","Several hundred tonnes of water concentrated on the roof make each tank a structure that resists hydrostatic and sloshing pressure: concrete tanks need crack-width control and a waterproof liner, while steel or glass-fibre tanks need attention to joints and corrosion protection."],"answer":2,"explanation":"數百公噸的水集中在屋頂，水槽本身就是承受靜水壓與晃動動壓的結構：混凝土水槽須控制裂縫寬度並加防水內襯，鋼或玻璃纖維水槽則要處理接縫與防蝕。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Several hundred tonnes of water concentrated on the roof make each tank a structure that resists hydrostatic and sloshing pressure: concrete tanks need crack-width control and a waterproof liner, while steel or glass-fibre tanks need attention to joints and corrosion protection. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b067-v13-18","title":"水槽結構、防水與分階段注水：定量估算","titleEn":"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「水槽結構與防水層」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tank structure and waterproofing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：靜水壓 p = ρgh。液柱垂直段靜水深 4.0 m 加上 0.5 m 振幅，最大水頭 4.5 m：p = 1,000×9.81×4.5 ≈ 44.1 kPa，槽壁每延米合力 F = ½ρgh² = 0.5×9,810×4.5² ≈ 99.3 kN/m；194 t 的水對屋頂結構另增約 1,900 kN 的重量。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Hydrostatic pressure p = ρgh. With 4.0 m of still water in a vertical leg plus 0.5 m amplitude, the maximum head is 4.5 m: p = 1,000×9.81×4.5 ≈ 44.1 kPa and the wall resultant per metre is F = ½ρgh² = 0.5×9,810×4.5² ≈ 99.3 kN/m; the 194 t of water adds about 1,900 kN of weight to the roof structure. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：注水前對防水層與接縫做目視與真空箱或電火花檢漏，注水分 25%、50%、75%、100% 四階段，每階段靜置後量測樓板撓度、水位下降量與槽外滲漏，撓度與滲漏都在允收值內才進入下一階段。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before filling, inspect the liner and joints visually and by vacuum-box or spark testing; fill in four stages of 25%, 50%, 75% and 100%, and after each hold measure slab deflection, level drop and external seepage, proceeding only when deflection and leakage are within acceptance limits.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"靜水壓 p = ρgh。液柱垂直段靜水深 4.0 m 加上 0.5 m 振幅，最大水頭 4.5 m：p = 1,000×9.81×4.5 ≈ 44.1 kPa，槽壁每延米合力 F = ½ρgh² = 0.5×9,810×4.5² ≈ 99.3 kN/m；194 t 的水對屋頂結構另增約 1,900 kN 的重量。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Hydrostatic pressure p = ρgh. With 4.0 m of still water in a vertical leg plus 0.5 m amplitude, the maximum head is 4.5 m: p = 1,000×9.81×4.5 ≈ 44.1 kPa and the wall resultant per metre is F = ½ρgh² = 0.5×9,810×4.5² ≈ 99.3 kN/m; the 194 t of water adds about 1,900 kN of weight to the roof structure. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水槽結構、防水與分階段注水」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling\", which statement holds?","options":["靜水壓 p = ρgh。","只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。","水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。"],"optionsEn":["Hydrostatic pressure p = ρgh.","A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works.","Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake."],"answer":0,"explanation":"靜水壓 p = ρgh。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Hydrostatic pressure p = ρgh. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b067-v13-19","title":"水槽結構、防水與分階段注水：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水槽結構與防水層」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tank structure and waterproofing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"注水前對防水層與接縫做目視與真空箱或電火花檢漏，注水分 25%、50%、75%、100% 四階段，每階段靜置後量測樓板撓度、水位下降量與槽外滲漏，撓度與滲漏都在允收值內才進入下一階段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before filling, inspect the liner and joints visually and by vacuum-box or spark testing; fill in four stages of 25%, 50%, 75% and 100%, and after each hold measure slab deflection, level drop and external seepage, proceeding only when deflection and leakage are within acceptance limits. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：水槽施工計畫要列出注水分段、每段持壓時間、撓度與滲漏的停止條件，並由結構設計者與防水承包商共同簽認；注水試驗期間，水槽下方樓層應暫緩精裝修。","observationEn":"Site practice: The tank construction plan should list filling stages, hold times and stop criteria for deflection and leakage, signed by both the structural designer and the waterproofing contractor; finishes on the floor below should be held back during the fill test.","failure":"注意干擾：混凝土水槽若未控制乾縮與溫度裂縫，滿水後滲漏會進入下層住戶或機電空間，持續失水又使阻尼器脫調；一次注滿而不分階段，可能在發現樓板撓度異常前就已造成裂縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Concrete tanks without control of shrinkage and thermal cracking leak into the dwellings or plant rooms below once full, and the continuous loss of water also detunes the damper; filling in one go may crack the slab before abnormal deflection is noticed. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"注水前對防水層與接縫做目視與真空箱或電火花檢漏，注水分 25%、50%、75%、100% 四階段，每階段靜置後量測樓板撓度、水位下降量與槽外滲漏，撓度與滲漏都在允收值內才進入下一階段。","textEn":"Before filling, inspect the liner and joints visually and by vacuum-box or spark testing; fill in four stages of 25%, 50%, 75% and 100%, and after each hold measure slab deflection, level drop and external seepage, proceeding only when deflection and leakage are within acceptance limits.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"水槽施工計畫要列出注水分段、每段持壓時間、撓度與滲漏的停止條件，並由結構設計者與防水承包商共同簽認；注水試驗期間，水槽下方樓層應暫緩精裝修。","textEn":"The tank construction plan should list filling stages, hold times and stop criteria for deflection and leakage, signed by both the structural designer and the waterproofing contractor; finishes on the floor below should be held back during the fill test.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水槽結構、防水與分階段注水」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","注水前對防水層與接縫做目視與真空箱或電火花檢漏，注水分 25%、50%、75%、100% 四階段，每階段靜置後量測樓板撓度、水位下降量與槽外滲漏，撓度與滲漏都在允收值內才進入下一階段。","水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Before filling, inspect the liner and joints visually and by vacuum-box or spark testing.","The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency."],"answer":1,"explanation":"注水前對防水層與接縫做目視與真空箱或電火花檢漏，注水分 25%、50%、75%、100% 四階段，每階段靜置後量測樓板撓度、水位下降量與槽外滲漏，撓度與滲漏都在允收值內才進入下一階段。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before filling, inspect the liner and joints visually and by vacuum-box or spark testing; fill in four stages of 25%, 50%, 75% and 100%, and after each hold measure slab deflection, level drop and external seepage, proceeding only when deflection and leakage are within acceptance limits. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b067-v13-20","title":"水槽結構、防水與分階段注水：失效診斷","titleEn":"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「水槽結構與防水層」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tank structure and waterproofing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"混凝土水槽若未控制乾縮與溫度裂縫，滿水後滲漏會進入下層住戶或機電空間，持續失水又使阻尼器脫調；一次注滿而不分階段，可能在發現樓板撓度異常前就已造成裂縫。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Concrete tanks without control of shrinkage and thermal cracking leak into the dwellings or plant rooms below once full, and the continuous loss of water also detunes the damper; filling in one go may crack the slab before abnormal deflection is noticed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：注水必須分階段進行，一方面確認樓板撓度與滲漏，一方面在每個水位量測頻率，逐步逼近調頻水位。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Filling is done in stages, both to check slab deflection and leakage and to measure frequency at each level while approaching the tuning depth.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"混凝土水槽若未控制乾縮與溫度裂縫，滿水後滲漏會進入下層住戶或機電空間，持續失水又使阻尼器脫調；一次注滿而不分階段，可能在發現樓板撓度異常前就已造成裂縫。","textEn":"Concrete tanks without control of shrinkage and thermal cracking leak into the dwellings or plant rooms below once full, and the continuous loss of water also detunes the damper; filling in one go may crack the slab before abnormal deflection is noticed.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水槽結構、防水與分階段注水」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Tank structure, waterproofing and staged filling\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。","混凝土水槽若未控制乾縮與溫度裂縫，滿水後滲漏會進入下層住戶或機電空間，持續失水又使阻尼器脫調；一次注滿而不分階段，可能在發現樓板撓度異常前就已造成裂縫。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.","Concrete tanks without control of shrinkage and thermal cracking leak into the dwellings or plant rooms below once full, and the continuous loss of water also detunes the damper."],"answer":2,"explanation":"混凝土水槽若未控制乾縮與溫度裂縫，滿水後滲漏會進入下層住戶或機電空間，持續失水又使阻尼器脫調；一次注滿而不分階段，可能在發現樓板撓度異常前就已造成裂縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Concrete tanks without control of shrinkage and thermal cracking leak into the dwellings or plant rooms below once full, and the continuous loss of water also detunes the damper; filling in one go may crack the slab before abnormal deflection is noticed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b067-v13-21","title":"實測建築頻率與現場調頻：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Measured building frequency and field tuning: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「調頻水位」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Tuning water level” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"完工建築的實際頻率常與分析值不同；One Wall Centre 的公開報導指出，建築與液柱阻尼器頻率須相差 10% 以內才有效，而其分析與第 41 層實測頻率相差約 3.2%。TLD 最大的優點是現場調頻容易：淺水槽改變水深，液柱阻尼器改變水量或液柱長度，即可移動頻率；但水深降低時參與的水也減少，質量比隨之下降，調頻與有效質量必須一起檢查。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「調頻水位」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The real frequency of a completed building often differs from analysis; published accounts of One Wall Centre note that building and liquid-column damper frequencies must be within 10% for the damper to work, and that analysis and measurement at level 41 agreed within about 3.2%. The great advantage of a TLD is easy field tuning: changing water depth in a shallow tank, or water volume or column length in a column damper, shifts the frequency; but lowering the depth also removes water and lowers the mass ratio, so tuning and effective mass must be checked together. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Tuning water level” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若建築實測 f₁ = 0.185 Hz（設計 0.20 Hz），目標槽頻 f = 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz，ω² = 1.312；tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255，πh/L ≈ 0.261，h ≈ 0.50 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If the measured f₁ = 0.185 Hz instead of the design 0.20 Hz, the target tank frequency is 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz and ω² = 1.312; tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255, so πh/L ≈ 0.261 and h ≈ 0.50 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「調頻水位」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Tuning water level”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-21-k1","title":"實測建築頻率與現場調頻","titleEn":"Measured building frequency and field tuning","text":"完工建築的實際頻率常與分析值不同；One Wall Centre 的公開報導指出，建築與液柱阻尼器頻率須相差 10% 以內才有效，而其分析與第 41 層實測頻率相差約 3.2%。TLD 最大的優點是現場調頻容易：淺水槽改變水深，液柱阻尼器改變水量或液柱長度，即可移動頻率；但水深降低時參與的水也減少，質量比隨之下降，調頻與有效質量必須一起檢查。","textEn":"The real frequency of a completed building often differs from analysis; published accounts of One Wall Centre note that building and liquid-column damper frequencies must be within 10% for the damper to work, and that analysis and measurement at level 41 agreed within about 3.2%. The great advantage of a TLD is easy field tuning: changing water depth in a shallow tank, or water volume or column length in a column damper, shifts the frequency; but lowering the depth also removes water and lowers the mass ratio, so tuning and effective mass must be checked together.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「實測建築頻率與現場調頻」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Measured building frequency and field tuning\" is correct?","options":["完工建築的實際頻率常與分析值不同。","液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。","縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。"],"optionsEn":["The real frequency of a completed building often differs from analysis.","Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.","A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions."],"answer":0,"explanation":"完工建築的實際頻率常與分析值不同；One Wall Centre 的公開報導指出，建築與液柱阻尼器頻率須相差 10% 以內才有效，而其分析與第 41 層實測頻率相差約 3.2%。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The real frequency of a completed building often differs from analysis; published accounts of One Wall Centre note that building and liquid-column damper frequencies must be within 10% for the damper to work, and that analysis and measurement at level 41 agreed within about 3.2%. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b067-v13-22","title":"實測建築頻率與現場調頻：定量估算","titleEn":"Measured building frequency and field tuning: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「調頻水位」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Tuning water level” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若建築實測 f₁ = 0.185 Hz（設計 0.20 Hz），目標槽頻 f = 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz，ω² = 1.312；tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255，πh/L ≈ 0.261，h ≈ 0.50 m。40 槽總水量由 576 降為約 479 m³，有效質量比降為約 1.26%，需增至約 48 槽才回到 1.5%。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If the measured f₁ = 0.185 Hz instead of the design 0.20 Hz, the target tank frequency is 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz and ω² = 1.312; tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255, so πh/L ≈ 0.261 and h ≈ 0.50 m. The water in 40 tanks drops from 576 to about 479 m³ and the effective mass ratio to about 1.26%, so about 48 tanks are needed to return to 1.5%. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以環境振動量測，在水槽排空或閘門鎖住時與注水後分別辨識建築頻率；再以水位計量測各槽自由晃動頻率，確認全部水槽落在目標值 ±2% 內，最後記錄每槽實際水深作為交接基準。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Identify the building frequency from ambient vibration both with tanks empty or gates locked and after filling; then measure the free-sloshing frequency of each tank with level gauges, confirm all tanks are within ±2% of the target, and record each tank's actual depth as the handover baseline.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若建築實測 f₁ = 0.185 Hz（設計 0.20 Hz），目標槽頻 f = 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz，ω² = 1.312；tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255，πh/L ≈ 0.261，h ≈ 0.50 m。40 槽總水量由 576 降為約 479 m³，有效質量比降為約 1.26%，需增至約 48 槽才回到 1.5%。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"If the measured f₁ = 0.185 Hz instead of the design 0.20 Hz, the target tank frequency is 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz and ω² = 1.312; tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255, so πh/L ≈ 0.261 and h ≈ 0.50 m. The water in 40 tanks drops from 576 to about 479 m³ and the effective mass ratio to about 1.26%, so about 48 tanks are needed to return to 1.5%. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「實測建築頻率與現場調頻」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Measured building frequency and field tuning\", which statement holds?","options":["水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。","若建築實測 f₁ = 0.185 Hz（設計 0.20 Hz），目標槽頻 f = 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz，ω² = 1.312。","水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。"],"optionsEn":["As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.","If the measured f₁ = 0.185 Hz instead of the design 0.20 Hz, the target tank frequency is 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz and ω² = 1.312.","All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若建築實測 f₁ = 0.185 Hz（設計 0.20 Hz），目標槽頻 f = 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz，ω² = 1.312；tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255，πh/L ≈ 0.261，h ≈ 0.50 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If the measured f₁ = 0.185 Hz instead of the design 0.20 Hz, the target tank frequency is 0.185/(1+0.015) ≈ 0.182 Hz and ω² = 1.312; tanh(πh/L) = ω²L/(πg) = 1.312×6/30.82 ≈ 0.255, so πh/L ≈ 0.261 and h ≈ 0.50 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b067-v13-23","title":"實測建築頻率與現場調頻：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Measured building frequency and field tuning: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「調頻水位」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Tuning water level” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以環境振動量測，在水槽排空或閘門鎖住時與注水後分別辨識建築頻率；再以水位計量測各槽自由晃動頻率，確認全部水槽落在目標值 ±2% 內，最後記錄每槽實際水深作為交接基準。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Identify the building frequency from ambient vibration both with tanks empty or gates locked and after filling; then measure the free-sloshing frequency of each tank with level gauges, confirm all tanks are within ±2% of the target, and record each tank's actual depth as the handover baseline. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計階段就預留增設水槽的空間與樓板承載，或把水槽設計成可在一段水深範圍內工作；調頻作業安排在帷幕牆與主要裝修完成後，並把每槽水深、水位計零點與實測頻率列表交接。","observationEn":"Site practice: Reserve space and slab capacity for extra tanks at design stage, or design tanks to work across a range of depths; carry out tuning after the façade and major fit-out are complete, and hand over a table of each tank's depth, gauge zero and measured frequency.","failure":"注意干擾：只把水深調到頻率吻合而沒有重算有效質量，有效質量比可能少約 16%，等效阻尼隨之下降；各槽水深若不一致，水槽頻率分散，整體表現像許多小阻尼器各自為政，峰值降低有限。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Adjusting depth only for frequency without recomputing effective mass can leave the effective mass ratio about 16% short, with equivalent damping falling accordingly; inconsistent depths across tanks scatter their frequencies, so the array behaves like many small dampers acting independently and the peak reduction is limited. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以環境振動量測，在水槽排空或閘門鎖住時與注水後分別辨識建築頻率；再以水位計量測各槽自由晃動頻率，確認全部水槽落在目標值 ±2% 內，最後記錄每槽實際水深作為交接基準。","textEn":"Identify the building frequency from ambient vibration both with tanks empty or gates locked and after filling; then measure the free-sloshing frequency of each tank with level gauges, confirm all tanks are within ±2% of the target, and record each tank's actual depth as the handover baseline.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計階段就預留增設水槽的空間與樓板承載，或把水槽設計成可在一段水深範圍內工作；調頻作業安排在帷幕牆與主要裝修完成後，並把每槽水深、水位計零點與實測頻率列表交接。","textEn":"Reserve space and slab capacity for extra tanks at design stage, or design tanks to work across a range of depths; carry out tuning after the façade and major fit-out are complete, and hand over a table of each tank's depth, gauge zero and measured frequency.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「實測建築頻率與現場調頻」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Measured building frequency and field tuning\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。","以環境振動量測，在水槽排空或閘門鎖住時與注水後分別辨識建築頻率。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.","Identify the building frequency from ambient vibration both with tanks empty or gates locked and after filling."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以環境振動量測，在水槽排空或閘門鎖住時與注水後分別辨識建築頻率；再以水位計量測各槽自由晃動頻率，確認全部水槽落在目標值 ±2% 內，最後記錄每槽實際水深作為交接基準。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Identify the building frequency from ambient vibration both with tanks empty or gates locked and after filling; then measure the free-sloshing frequency of each tank with level gauges, confirm all tanks are within ±2% of the target, and record each tank's actual depth as the handover baseline. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b067-v13-24","title":"實測建築頻率與現場調頻：失效診斷","titleEn":"Measured building frequency and field tuning: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「調頻水位」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Tuning water level” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只把水深調到頻率吻合而沒有重算有效質量，有效質量比可能少約 16%，等效阻尼隨之下降；各槽水深若不一致，水槽頻率分散，整體表現像許多小阻尼器各自為政，峰值降低有限。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Adjusting depth only for frequency without recomputing effective mass can leave the effective mass ratio about 16% short, with equivalent damping falling accordingly; inconsistent depths across tanks scatter their frequencies, so the array behaves like many small dampers acting independently and the peak reduction is limited. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：TLD 最大的優點是現場調頻容易：淺水槽改變水深，液柱阻尼器改變水量或液柱長度，即可移動頻率；但水深降低時參與的水也減少，質量比隨之下降，調頻與有效質量必須一起檢查。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The great advantage of a TLD is easy field tuning: changing water depth in a shallow tank, or water volume or column length in a column damper, shifts the frequency; but lowering the depth also removes water and lowers the mass ratio, so tuning and effective mass must be checked together.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只把水深調到頻率吻合而沒有重算有效質量，有效質量比可能少約 16%，等效阻尼隨之下降；各槽水深若不一致，水槽頻率分散，整體表現像許多小阻尼器各自為政，峰值降低有限。","textEn":"Adjusting depth only for frequency without recomputing effective mass can leave the effective mass ratio about 16% short, with equivalent damping falling accordingly; inconsistent depths across tanks scatter their frequencies, so the array behaves like many small dampers acting independently and the peak reduction is limited.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「實測建築頻率與現場調頻」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Measured building frequency and field tuning\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只把水深調到頻率吻合而沒有重算有效質量，有效質量比可能少約 16%，等效阻尼隨之下降。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。"],"optionsEn":["Adjusting depth only for frequency without recomputing effective mass can leave the effective mass ratio about 16% short, with equivalent damping falling accordingly.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只把水深調到頻率吻合而沒有重算有效質量，有效質量比可能少約 16%，等效阻尼隨之下降；各槽水深若不一致，水槽頻率分散，整體表現像許多小阻尼器各自為政，峰值降低有限。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Adjusting depth only for frequency without recomputing effective mass can leave the effective mass ratio about 16% short, with equivalent damping falling accordingly; inconsistent depths across tanks scatter their frequencies, so the array behaves like many small dampers acting independently and the peak reduction is limited. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b067-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「福祿數相似律與模型試驗」與「完工監測與等效阻尼識別」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Froude similitude and model testing\" and \"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b067-v13-25","title":"福祿數相似律與模型試驗：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Froude similitude and model testing: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「縮尺水槽振動台試驗」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Scaled tank shaking-table test” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"晃動由重力主導，縮尺試驗必須維持福祿數相同：幾何縮小 λ 倍時，頻率放大 √λ 倍、時間縮短 √λ 倍、振幅縮小 λ 倍。這讓工程師能在實驗室振動台上以小水槽重現碎波與阻尼網效果，One Rincon Hill 的水槽即曾在加拿大西安大略大學測試。但雷諾數無法同時相似，小模型的黏性損失相對偏大，阻尼網的損失係數最好以接近實尺度的樣品校核。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「縮尺水槽振動台試驗」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Sloshing is gravity-dominated, so scaled tests must preserve the Froude number: shrinking geometry by λ raises frequency by √λ, shortens time by √λ and reduces amplitude by λ. This lets engineers reproduce wave breaking and screen effects with small tanks on a laboratory shaking table; the tanks for One Rincon Hill were tested at the University of Western Ontario. Reynolds number cannot be matched at the same time, so viscous losses are relatively larger in small models, and screen loss coefficients are best checked with near-full-scale samples. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Scaled tank shaking-table test” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：實尺度槽 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m、f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz；以 λ = 5 縮尺為 L = 1.2 m、h = 0.12 m，模型頻率 f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz；實尺度 0.10 m 的建築振幅在模型中只需 0.02 m，10 分鐘的實尺度風暴對應約 600/√5 ≈ 268 s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A full-scale tank with L = 6.0 m, h = 0.60 m and f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz becomes L = 1.2 m and h = 0.12 m at λ = 5; the model frequency is f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz, a 0.10 m full-scale building amplitude needs only 0.02 m in the model, and a 10-minute full-scale storm corresponds to about 600/√5 ≈ 268 s.","failure":"常見誤解：「縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「縮尺水槽振動台試驗」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Scaled tank shaking-table test”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-25-k1","title":"福祿數相似律與模型試驗","titleEn":"Froude similitude and model testing","text":"晃動由重力主導，縮尺試驗必須維持福祿數相同：幾何縮小 λ 倍時，頻率放大 √λ 倍、時間縮短 √λ 倍、振幅縮小 λ 倍。這讓工程師能在實驗室振動台上以小水槽重現碎波與阻尼網效果，One Rincon Hill 的水槽即曾在加拿大西安大略大學測試。","textEn":"Sloshing is gravity-dominated, so scaled tests must preserve the Froude number: shrinking geometry by λ raises frequency by √λ, shortens time by √λ and reduces amplitude by λ. This lets engineers reproduce wave breaking and screen effects with small tanks on a laboratory shaking table; the tanks for One Rincon Hill were tested at the University of Western Ontario.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「福祿數相似律與模型試驗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Froude similitude and model testing\" is correct?","options":["縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。","晃動由重力主導，縮尺試驗必須維持福祿數相同：幾何縮小 λ 倍時，頻率放大 √λ 倍、時間縮短 √λ 倍、振幅縮小 λ 倍。","只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。"],"optionsEn":["A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions.","Sloshing is gravity-dominated, so scaled tests must preserve the Froude number: shrinking geometry by λ raises frequency by √λ, shortens time by √λ and reduces amplitude by λ.","A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works."],"answer":1,"explanation":"晃動由重力主導，縮尺試驗必須維持福祿數相同：幾何縮小 λ 倍時，頻率放大 √λ 倍、時間縮短 √λ 倍、振幅縮小 λ 倍。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Sloshing is gravity-dominated, so scaled tests must preserve the Froude number: shrinking geometry by λ raises frequency by √λ, shortens time by √λ and reduces amplitude by λ. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b067-v13-26","title":"福祿數相似律與模型試驗：定量估算","titleEn":"Froude similitude and model testing: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「縮尺水槽振動台試驗」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Scaled tank shaking-table test” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：實尺度槽 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m、f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz；以 λ = 5 縮尺為 L = 1.2 m、h = 0.12 m，模型頻率 f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz；實尺度 0.10 m 的建築振幅在模型中只需 0.02 m，10 分鐘的實尺度風暴對應約 600/√5 ≈ 268 s。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A full-scale tank with L = 6.0 m, h = 0.60 m and f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz becomes L = 1.2 m and h = 0.12 m at λ = 5; the model frequency is f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz, a 0.10 m full-scale building amplitude needs only 0.02 m in the model, and a 10-minute full-scale storm corresponds to about 600/√5 ≈ 268 s. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：振動台以實測或合成的建築頂部位移歷時驅動模型水槽，以荷重元量測槽底水平力、以波高計量測水面，計算力與位移的相位與每循環耗能；結果換算回實尺度後，與數值模型預測的等效阻尼比較，差異須能解釋。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Drive the model tank on the shaking table with measured or synthetic top-floor displacement histories, measure base shear with load cells and the free surface with wave gauges, and compute the force–displacement phase and energy per cycle; scale the results back to full size and compare the equivalent damping with numerical predictions, requiring explainable differences.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"實尺度槽 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m、f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz；以 λ = 5 縮尺為 L = 1.2 m、h = 0.12 m，模型頻率 f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz；實尺度 0.10 m 的建築振幅在模型中只需 0.02 m，10 分鐘的實尺度風暴對應約 600/√5 ≈ 268 s。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A full-scale tank with L = 6.0 m, h = 0.60 m and f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz becomes L = 1.2 m and h = 0.12 m at λ = 5; the model frequency is f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz, a 0.10 m full-scale building amplitude needs only 0.02 m in the model, and a 10-minute full-scale storm corresponds to about 600/√5 ≈ 268 s. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「福祿數相似律與模型試驗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Froude similitude and model testing\", which statement holds?","options":["水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。","水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。","實尺度槽 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m、f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz。"],"optionsEn":["Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake.","The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency.","A full-scale tank with L = 6.0 m, h = 0.60 m and f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz becomes L = 1.2 m and h = 0.12 m at λ = 5."],"answer":2,"explanation":"實尺度槽 L = 6.0 m、h = 0.60 m、f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz；以 λ = 5 縮尺為 L = 1.2 m、h = 0.12 m，模型頻率 f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz；實尺度 0.10 m 的建築振幅在模型中只需 0.02 m，10 分鐘的實尺度風暴對應約 600/√5 ≈ 268 s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A full-scale tank with L = 6.0 m, h = 0.60 m and f_p ≈ 0.199 Hz becomes L = 1.2 m and h = 0.12 m at λ = 5; the model frequency is f_m = f_p·√5 ≈ 0.445 Hz, a 0.10 m full-scale building amplitude needs only 0.02 m in the model, and a 10-minute full-scale storm corresponds to about 600/√5 ≈ 268 s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b067-v13-27","title":"福祿數相似律與模型試驗：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Froude similitude and model testing: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「縮尺水槽振動台試驗」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Scaled tank shaking-table test” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"振動台以實測或合成的建築頂部位移歷時驅動模型水槽，以荷重元量測槽底水平力、以波高計量測水面，計算力與位移的相位與每循環耗能；結果換算回實尺度後，與數值模型預測的等效阻尼比較，差異須能解釋。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Drive the model tank on the shaking table with measured or synthetic top-floor displacement histories, measure base shear with load cells and the free surface with wave gauges, and compute the force–displacement phase and energy per cycle; scale the results back to full size and compare the equivalent damping with numerical predictions, requiring explainable differences. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：試驗計畫應列出相似律、縮尺比、輸入歷時、量測儀器與允收比較方式並保留原始資料；阻尼網或閘門的設計值，須經接近實尺度的元件試驗確認後才定案。","observationEn":"Site practice: The test plan should list the similitude law, scale, input histories, instruments and acceptance comparison, and keep raw data; screen or gate design values should be fixed only after near-full-scale component tests.","failure":"注意干擾：若縮尺試驗沿用實尺度水深而只縮小平面，頻率與碎波行為都不相似，得到的阻尼會誤導設計；只做正弦試驗而不做隨機激振，也可能高估實際風況下的效果。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Scaling only the plan while keeping full-scale depth makes neither frequency nor wave breaking similar, and the damping obtained misleads the design; running only sinusoidal tests without random excitation can also overstate performance in real wind. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"振動台以實測或合成的建築頂部位移歷時驅動模型水槽，以荷重元量測槽底水平力、以波高計量測水面，計算力與位移的相位與每循環耗能；結果換算回實尺度後，與數值模型預測的等效阻尼比較，差異須能解釋。","textEn":"Drive the model tank on the shaking table with measured or synthetic top-floor displacement histories, measure base shear with load cells and the free surface with wave gauges, and compute the force–displacement phase and energy per cycle; scale the results back to full size and compare the equivalent damping with numerical predictions, requiring explainable differences.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"試驗計畫應列出相似律、縮尺比、輸入歷時、量測儀器與允收比較方式並保留原始資料；阻尼網或閘門的設計值，須經接近實尺度的元件試驗確認後才定案。","textEn":"The test plan should list the similitude law, scale, input histories, instruments and acceptance comparison, and keep raw data; screen or gate design values should be fixed only after near-full-scale component tests.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「福祿數相似律與模型試驗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Froude similitude and model testing\"?","options":["振動台以實測或合成的建築頂部位移歷時驅動模型水槽，以荷重元量測槽底水平力、以波高計量測水面，計算力與位移的相位與每循環耗能。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。"],"optionsEn":["Drive the model tank on the shaking table with measured or synthetic top-floor displacement histories, measure base shear with load cells and the free surface with wave gauges, and compute the force–displacement phase and energy per cycle.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude."],"answer":0,"explanation":"振動台以實測或合成的建築頂部位移歷時驅動模型水槽，以荷重元量測槽底水平力、以波高計量測水面，計算力與位移的相位與每循環耗能；結果換算回實尺度後，與數值模型預測的等效阻尼比較，差異須能解釋。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Drive the model tank on the shaking table with measured or synthetic top-floor displacement histories, measure base shear with load cells and the free surface with wave gauges, and compute the force–displacement phase and energy per cycle; scale the results back to full size and compare the equivalent damping with numerical predictions, requiring explainable differences. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b067-v13-28","title":"福祿數相似律與模型試驗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Froude similitude and model testing: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「縮尺水槽振動台試驗」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Scaled tank shaking-table test” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若縮尺試驗沿用實尺度水深而只縮小平面，頻率與碎波行為都不相似，得到的阻尼會誤導設計；只做正弦試驗而不做隨機激振，也可能高估實際風況下的效果。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Scaling only the plan while keeping full-scale depth makes neither frequency nor wave breaking similar, and the damping obtained misleads the design; running only sinusoidal tests without random excitation can also overstate performance in real wind. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：但雷諾數無法同時相似，小模型的黏性損失相對偏大，阻尼網的損失係數最好以接近實尺度的樣品校核。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Reynolds number cannot be matched at the same time, so viscous losses are relatively larger in small models, and screen loss coefficients are best checked with near-full-scale samples.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若縮尺試驗沿用實尺度水深而只縮小平面，頻率與碎波行為都不相似，得到的阻尼會誤導設計；只做正弦試驗而不做隨機激振，也可能高估實際風況下的效果。","textEn":"Scaling only the plan while keeping full-scale depth makes neither frequency nor wave breaking similar, and the damping obtained misleads the design; running only sinusoidal tests without random excitation can also overstate performance in real wind.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「福祿數相似律與模型試驗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Froude similitude and model testing\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若縮尺試驗沿用實尺度水深而只縮小平面，頻率與碎波行為都不相似，得到的阻尼會誤導設計；只做正弦試驗而不做隨機激振，也可能高估實際風況下的效果。","只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Scaling only the plan while keeping full-scale depth makes neither frequency nor wave breaking similar, and the damping obtained misleads the design.","A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若縮尺試驗沿用實尺度水深而只縮小平面，頻率與碎波行為都不相似，得到的阻尼會誤導設計；只做正弦試驗而不做隨機激振，也可能高估實際風況下的效果。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Scaling only the plan while keeping full-scale depth makes neither frequency nor wave breaking similar, and the damping obtained misleads the design; running only sinusoidal tests without random excitation can also overstate performance in real wind. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b067-v13-29","title":"完工監測與等效阻尼識別：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「波高計與頂層加速度計」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Wave gauges and roof accelerometers” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"完工後要證明水槽在真實風況下有效，需要同時量測建築頂層加速度、各水槽水位與風速風向。水位與建築位移的相位差可判斷是否調諧：接近共振時，水面晃動落後建築約 90 度；加速度紀錄則以隨機遞減法或系統識別求出含 TLD 的總阻尼比。由於 TLD 是非線性，阻尼比必須依振幅分組比較，不能只報一個數字。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「波高計與頂層加速度計」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"To prove the tanks work in real wind after completion, measure roof acceleration, the water level in the tanks and wind speed and direction at the same time. The phase between water level and building displacement shows whether the damper is tuned: near resonance the sloshing lags the building by about 90 degrees; the acceleration records give the total damping ratio including the TLD by the random-decrement method or system identification. Because a TLD is nonlinear, damping must be grouped and compared by amplitude rather than reported as a single number. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Wave gauges and roof accelerometers” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：對寬頻風力，均方根加速度約與 1/√ζ_total 成正比。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For broadband wind forcing, RMS acceleration is roughly proportional to 1/√ζ_total.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「波高計與頂層加速度計」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Wave gauges and roof accelerometers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-29-k1","title":"完工監測與等效阻尼識別","titleEn":"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification","text":"完工後要證明水槽在真實風況下有效，需要同時量測建築頂層加速度、各水槽水位與風速風向。水位與建築位移的相位差可判斷是否調諧：接近共振時，水面晃動落後建築約 90 度；加速度紀錄則以隨機遞減法或系統識別求出含 TLD 的總阻尼比。","textEn":"To prove the tanks work in real wind after completion, measure roof acceleration, the water level in the tanks and wind speed and direction at the same time. The phase between water level and building displacement shows whether the damper is tuned: near resonance the sloshing lags the building by about 90 degrees; the acceleration records give the total damping ratio including the TLD by the random-decrement method or system identification.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「完工監測與等效阻尼識別」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification\" is correct?","options":["只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。","水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。","完工後要證明水槽在真實風況下有效，需要同時量測建築頂層加速度、各水槽水位與風速風向。"],"optionsEn":["A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works.","As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.","To prove the tanks work in real wind after completion, measure roof acceleration, the water level in the tanks and wind speed and direction at the same time."],"answer":2,"explanation":"完工後要證明水槽在真實風況下有效，需要同時量測建築頂層加速度、各水槽水位與風速風向。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"To prove the tanks work in real wind after completion, measure roof acceleration, the water level in the tanks and wind speed and direction at the same time. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b067-v13-30","title":"完工監測與等效阻尼識別：定量估算","titleEn":"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「波高計與頂層加速度計」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Wave gauges and roof accelerometers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：對寬頻風力，均方根加速度約與 1/√ζ_total 成正比。結構阻尼 1.5%、加裝 TLD 後總阻尼 4.0% 時，加速度比 = √(1.5/4.0) ≈ 0.61，約降低 39%；若實測總阻尼只有 3.0%，比值為 √(1.5/3.0) ≈ 0.71，降幅縮為約 29%。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For broadband wind forcing, RMS acceleration is roughly proportional to 1/√ζ_total. With 1.5% structural damping and 4.0% total damping with the TLD, the acceleration ratio is √(1.5/4.0) ≈ 0.61, a reduction of about 39%; if only 3.0% total damping is measured, the ratio is √(1.5/3.0) ≈ 0.71 and the reduction shrinks to about 29%. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：監測至少涵蓋一個強風季節，把每段 10 分鐘紀錄依頂層加速度振幅分組，求出各組的頻率與總阻尼，與設計的阻尼—振幅曲線比較；必要時短暫降低水位或鎖住閘門做對照量測，確認差異來自阻尼器而非風況變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Monitor through at least one windy season, group 10-minute records by roof acceleration amplitude, identify frequency and total damping for each group, and compare with the design damping–amplitude curve; where needed briefly lower the water or lock the gates for a comparison run to confirm the difference comes from the damper rather than changing wind.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"對寬頻風力，均方根加速度約與 1/√ζ_total 成正比。結構阻尼 1.5%、加裝 TLD 後總阻尼 4.0% 時，加速度比 = √(1.5/4.0) ≈ 0.61，約降低 39%；若實測總阻尼只有 3.0%，比值為 √(1.5/3.0) ≈ 0.71，降幅縮為約 29%。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"For broadband wind forcing, RMS acceleration is roughly proportional to 1/√ζ_total. With 1.5% structural damping and 4.0% total damping with the TLD, the acceleration ratio is √(1.5/4.0) ≈ 0.61, a reduction of about 39%; if only 3.0% total damping is measured, the ratio is √(1.5/3.0) ≈ 0.71 and the reduction shrinks to about 29%. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「完工監測與等效阻尼識別」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification\", which statement holds?","options":["對寬頻風力，均方根加速度約與 1/√ζ_total 成正比。","水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。","U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。"],"optionsEn":["For broadband wind forcing, RMS acceleration is roughly proportional to 1/√ζ_total.","All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass.","The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg."],"answer":0,"explanation":"對寬頻風力，均方根加速度約與 1/√ζ_total 成正比。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For broadband wind forcing, RMS acceleration is roughly proportional to 1/√ζ_total. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b067-v13-31","title":"完工監測與等效阻尼識別：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「波高計與頂層加速度計」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Wave gauges and roof accelerometers” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"監測至少涵蓋一個強風季節，把每段 10 分鐘紀錄依頂層加速度振幅分組，求出各組的頻率與總阻尼，與設計的阻尼—振幅曲線比較；必要時短暫降低水位或鎖住閘門做對照量測，確認差異來自阻尼器而非風況變化。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Monitor through at least one windy season, group 10-minute records by roof acceleration amplitude, identify frequency and total damping for each group, and compare with the design damping–amplitude curve; where needed briefly lower the water or lock the gates for a comparison run to confirm the difference comes from the damper rather than changing wind. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：監測報告要附各水槽水位、建築加速度與風資料的同步時間軸，並列明分組方式與識別方法；業主驗收應以設計振幅附近的資料為準，而非全部資料的平均。","observationEn":"Site practice: The monitoring report should include a synchronised timeline of tank levels, building acceleration and wind data and state the grouping and identification methods; owner acceptance should rest on data near the design amplitude rather than on an average of all records.","failure":"注意干擾：若只用低風速的環境振動資料識別阻尼，振幅太小使 TLD 幾乎不耗能，會誤判阻尼器無效；反之只挑幾次強風事件，又可能把風況差異誤當成阻尼器效果。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Identifying damping only from low-wind ambient data, where amplitudes are too small for the TLD to dissipate much, wrongly suggests the damper is ineffective; picking only a few strong-wind events can instead mistake differences in wind for damper performance. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"監測至少涵蓋一個強風季節，把每段 10 分鐘紀錄依頂層加速度振幅分組，求出各組的頻率與總阻尼，與設計的阻尼—振幅曲線比較；必要時短暫降低水位或鎖住閘門做對照量測，確認差異來自阻尼器而非風況變化。","textEn":"Monitor through at least one windy season, group 10-minute records by roof acceleration amplitude, identify frequency and total damping for each group, and compare with the design damping–amplitude curve; where needed briefly lower the water or lock the gates for a comparison run to confirm the difference comes from the damper rather than changing wind.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"監測報告要附各水槽水位、建築加速度與風資料的同步時間軸，並列明分組方式與識別方法；業主驗收應以設計振幅附近的資料為準，而非全部資料的平均。","textEn":"The monitoring report should include a synchronised timeline of tank levels, building acceleration and wind data and state the grouping and identification methods; owner acceptance should rest on data near the design amplitude rather than on an average of all records.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「完工監測與等效阻尼識別」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","監測至少涵蓋一個強風季節，把每段 10 分鐘紀錄依頂層加速度振幅分組，求出各組的頻率與總阻尼，與設計的阻尼—振幅曲線比較。","水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Monitor through at least one windy season, group 10-minute records by roof acceleration amplitude, identify frequency and total damping for each group, and compare with the design damping–amplitude curve.","A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member."],"answer":1,"explanation":"監測至少涵蓋一個強風季節，把每段 10 分鐘紀錄依頂層加速度振幅分組，求出各組的頻率與總阻尼，與設計的阻尼—振幅曲線比較；必要時短暫降低水位或鎖住閘門做對照量測，確認差異來自阻尼器而非風況變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Monitor through at least one windy season, group 10-minute records by roof acceleration amplitude, identify frequency and total damping for each group, and compare with the design damping–amplitude curve; where needed briefly lower the water or lock the gates for a comparison run to confirm the difference comes from the damper rather than changing wind. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b067-v13-32","title":"完工監測與等效阻尼識別：失效診斷","titleEn":"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「波高計與頂層加速度計」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Wave gauges and roof accelerometers” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若只用低風速的環境振動資料識別阻尼，振幅太小使 TLD 幾乎不耗能，會誤判阻尼器無效；反之只挑幾次強風事件，又可能把風況差異誤當成阻尼器效果。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Identifying damping only from low-wind ambient data, where amplitudes are too small for the TLD to dissipate much, wrongly suggests the damper is ineffective; picking only a few strong-wind events can instead mistake differences in wind for damper performance. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：由於 TLD 是非線性，阻尼比必須依振幅分組比較，不能只報一個數字。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Because a TLD is nonlinear, damping must be grouped and compared by amplitude rather than reported as a single number.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要在無風的日子量一次建築阻尼，就能證明液體阻尼器有效。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A single damping measurement on a calm day proves that a liquid damper works.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若只用低風速的環境振動資料識別阻尼，振幅太小使 TLD 幾乎不耗能，會誤判阻尼器無效；反之只挑幾次強風事件，又可能把風況差異誤當成阻尼器效果。","textEn":"Identifying damping only from low-wind ambient data, where amplitudes are too small for the TLD to dissipate much, wrongly suggests the damper is ineffective; picking only a few strong-wind events can instead mistake differences in wind for damper performance.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「完工監測與等效阻尼識別」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Post-completion monitoring and equivalent-damping identification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。","若只用低風速的環境振動資料識別阻尼，振幅太小使 TLD 幾乎不耗能，會誤判阻尼器無效；反之只挑幾次強風事件，又可能把風況差異誤當成阻尼器效果。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.","Identifying damping only from low-wind ambient data, where amplitudes are too small for the TLD to dissipate much, wrongly suggests the damper is ineffective."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若只用低風速的環境振動資料識別阻尼，振幅太小使 TLD 幾乎不耗能，會誤判阻尼器無效；反之只挑幾次強風事件，又可能把風況差異誤當成阻尼器效果。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Identifying damping only from low-wind ambient data, where amplitudes are too small for the TLD to dissipate much, wrongly suggests the damper is ineffective; picking only a few strong-wind events can instead mistake differences in wind for damper performance. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b067-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「蒸發、水質與防凍」與「極端事件、出水高度與交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection\" and \"Extreme events, freeboard and handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b067-v13-33","title":"蒸發、水質與防凍：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「補水與水質管理」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Make-up water and water quality” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"TLD 的質量就是水，水量變化就是調頻變化：通氣水槽會蒸發，閥門或接縫會滲漏，寒冷地區水面可能結冰，冰層不但改變晃動形態，也會讓阻尼網與水位計失效。靜止水體容易滋生藻類與微生物，常需添加殺菌劑或防凍劑，但添加物會改變密度與黏性，也可能腐蝕金屬阻尼網。水槽兼作消防水源時，火災後若未補足抽用的水，阻尼器會長期脫調。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「補水與水質管理」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A TLD's mass is its water, so any change in water is a change in tuning: vented tanks evaporate, valves and joints leak, and in cold climates the surface can freeze, which alters sloshing and disables screens and level gauges. Still water breeds algae and microbes, so biocides or antifreeze are often added, but additives change density and viscosity and may corrode metal screens. When the tanks double as fire storage, failing to refill after a fire draw-down leaves the damper detuned for a long time. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Make-up water and water quality” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：40 槽總水面約 960 m²，若日蒸發 1 mm，每月損失約 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³，即 576 m³ 的 5%，水深由 0.60 m 降到 0.57 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The 40 tanks expose about 960 m² of water; at 1 mm of evaporation per day the monthly loss is about 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³, 5% of 576 m³, lowering the depth from 0.60 m to 0.57 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「補水與水質管理」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Make-up water and water quality”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-33-k1","title":"蒸發、水質與防凍","titleEn":"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection","text":"TLD 的質量就是水，水量變化就是調頻變化：通氣水槽會蒸發，閥門或接縫會滲漏，寒冷地區水面可能結冰，冰層不但改變晃動形態，也會讓阻尼網與水位計失效。靜止水體容易滋生藻類與微生物，常需添加殺菌劑或防凍劑，但添加物會改變密度與黏性，也可能腐蝕金屬阻尼網。","textEn":"A TLD's mass is its water, so any change in water is a change in tuning: vented tanks evaporate, valves and joints leak, and in cold climates the surface can freeze, which alters sloshing and disables screens and level gauges. Still water breeds algae and microbes, so biocides or antifreeze are often added, but additives change density and viscosity and may corrode metal screens.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「蒸發、水質與防凍」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection\" is correct?","options":["TLD 的質量就是水，水量變化就是調頻變化：通氣水槽會蒸發，閥門或接縫會滲漏，寒冷地區水面可能結冰，冰層不但改變晃動形態，也會讓阻尼網與水位計失效。","水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。","水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。"],"optionsEn":["A TLD's mass is its water, so any change in water is a change in tuning: vented tanks evaporate, valves and joints leak, and in cold climates the surface can freeze, which alters sloshing and disables screens and level gauges.","As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.","Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake."],"answer":0,"explanation":"TLD 的質量就是水，水量變化就是調頻變化：通氣水槽會蒸發，閥門或接縫會滲漏，寒冷地區水面可能結冰，冰層不但改變晃動形態，也會讓阻尼網與水位計失效。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A TLD's mass is its water, so any change in water is a change in tuning: vented tanks evaporate, valves and joints leak, and in cold climates the surface can freeze, which alters sloshing and disables screens and level gauges. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b067-v13-34","title":"蒸發、水質與防凍：定量估算","titleEn":"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「補水與水質管理」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Make-up water and water quality” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：40 槽總水面約 960 m²，若日蒸發 1 mm，每月損失約 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³，即 576 m³ 的 5%，水深由 0.60 m 降到 0.57 m。tanh(π×0.57/6) = 0.290，頻率比 √(0.290/0.304) ≈ 0.976，頻率約下降 2.4%（0.199 → 0.194 Hz）。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The 40 tanks expose about 960 m² of water; at 1 mm of evaporation per day the monthly loss is about 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³, 5% of 576 m³, lowering the depth from 0.60 m to 0.57 m. With tanh(π×0.57/6) = 0.290, the frequency ratio is √(0.290/0.304) ≈ 0.976, a drop of about 2.4% (0.199 to 0.194 Hz). Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每槽設連續水位計並設定上下限警報（例如偏離調頻水位 ±10 mm），記錄自動補水閥的動作次數與補水量；每季取樣檢驗水質、添加劑濃度與密度，每年目視檢查阻尼網鏽蝕與沉積。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Fit each tank with a continuous level gauge and alarms at upper and lower limits (for example ±10 mm from the tuning level), and log auto-fill valve operations and volumes; sample water quality, additive concentration and density quarterly, and inspect screens for corrosion and deposits each year.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"40 槽總水面約 960 m²，若日蒸發 1 mm，每月損失約 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³，即 576 m³ 的 5%，水深由 0.60 m 降到 0.57 m。tanh(π×0.57/6) = 0.290，頻率比 √(0.290/0.304) ≈ 0.976，頻率約下降 2.4%（0.199 → 0.194 Hz）。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"The 40 tanks expose about 960 m² of water; at 1 mm of evaporation per day the monthly loss is about 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³, 5% of 576 m³, lowering the depth from 0.60 m to 0.57 m. With tanh(π×0.57/6) = 0.290, the frequency ratio is √(0.290/0.304) ≈ 0.976, a drop of about 2.4% (0.199 to 0.194 Hz). Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「蒸發、水質與防凍」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection\", which statement holds?","options":["水槽越寬、裝的水越多，晃動頻率就越低。","40 槽總水面約 960 m²，若日蒸發 1 mm，每月損失約 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³，即 576 m³ 的 5%，水深由 0.60 m 降到 0.57 m。","液體阻尼器的阻尼比和線性黏滯阻尼一樣是固定值，與振幅無關。"],"optionsEn":["The wider the tank and the more water it holds, the lower its sloshing frequency.","The 40 tanks expose about 960 m² of water.","A liquid damper's damping ratio is fixed like a linear viscous damper's and does not depend on amplitude."],"answer":1,"explanation":"40 槽總水面約 960 m²，若日蒸發 1 mm，每月損失約 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³，即 576 m³ 的 5%，水深由 0.60 m 降到 0.57 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The 40 tanks expose about 960 m² of water; at 1 mm of evaporation per day the monthly loss is about 0.96×30 ≈ 28.8 m³, 5% of 576 m³, lowering the depth from 0.60 m to 0.57 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b067-v13-35","title":"蒸發、水質與防凍：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「補水與水質管理」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Make-up water and water quality” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每槽設連續水位計並設定上下限警報（例如偏離調頻水位 ±10 mm），記錄自動補水閥的動作次數與補水量；每季取樣檢驗水質、添加劑濃度與密度，每年目視檢查阻尼網鏽蝕與沉積。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Fit each tank with a continuous level gauge and alarms at upper and lower limits (for example ±10 mm from the tuning level), and log auto-fill valve operations and volumes; sample water quality, additive concentration and density quarterly, and inspect screens for corrosion and deposits each year. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：維護手冊要把調頻水位、消防最低水位與溢流水位分別標示，並規定任何添加劑、清洗或排水作業前須通知結構顧問；水位警報應接到中央監控室。","observationEn":"Site practice: The maintenance manual should mark the tuning level, fire minimum level and overflow level separately, and require the structural consultant to be notified before any additive, cleaning or drainage work; level alarms should report to the central control room.","failure":"注意干擾：補水閥故障或水位計漂移時，水位慢慢下降數公分，建築照常使用卻已脫調，直到強風季住戶抱怨才被發現；加入防凍液而未重算密度與黏性，也會讓頻率與阻尼偏離試驗基準。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A failed fill valve or drifting gauge lets the level fall a few centimetres; the building stays in normal use but detuned until occupants complain in the windy season; adding antifreeze without recomputing density and viscosity also shifts frequency and damping away from the test baseline. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每槽設連續水位計並設定上下限警報（例如偏離調頻水位 ±10 mm），記錄自動補水閥的動作次數與補水量；每季取樣檢驗水質、添加劑濃度與密度，每年目視檢查阻尼網鏽蝕與沉積。","textEn":"Fit each tank with a continuous level gauge and alarms at upper and lower limits (for example ±10 mm from the tuning level), and log auto-fill valve operations and volumes; sample water quality, additive concentration and density quarterly, and inspect screens for corrosion and deposits each year.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"維護手冊要把調頻水位、消防最低水位與溢流水位分別標示，並規定任何添加劑、清洗或排水作業前須通知結構顧問；水位警報應接到中央監控室。","textEn":"The maintenance manual should mark the tuning level, fire minimum level and overflow level separately, and require the structural consultant to be notified before any additive, cleaning or drainage work; level alarms should report to the central control room.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「蒸發、水質與防凍」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","液體阻尼器調頻只要改水深，對質量比沒有影響。","每槽設連續水位計並設定上下限警報（例如偏離調頻水位 ±10 mm），記錄自動補水閥的動作次數與補水量。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Retuning a liquid damper by changing water depth has no effect on its mass ratio.","Fit each tank with a continuous level gauge and alarms at upper and lower limits (for example ±10 mm from the tuning level), and log auto-fill valve operations and volumes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每槽設連續水位計並設定上下限警報（例如偏離調頻水位 ±10 mm），記錄自動補水閥的動作次數與補水量；每季取樣檢驗水質、添加劑濃度與密度，每年目視檢查阻尼網鏽蝕與沉積。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Fit each tank with a continuous level gauge and alarms at upper and lower limits (for example ±10 mm from the tuning level), and log auto-fill valve operations and volumes; sample water quality, additive concentration and density quarterly, and inspect screens for corrosion and deposits each year. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b067-v13-36","title":"蒸發、水質與防凍：失效診斷","titleEn":"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「補水與水質管理」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Make-up water and water quality” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"補水閥故障或水位計漂移時，水位慢慢下降數公分，建築照常使用卻已脫調，直到強風季住戶抱怨才被發現；加入防凍液而未重算密度與黏性，也會讓頻率與阻尼偏離試驗基準。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A failed fill valve or drifting gauge lets the level fall a few centimetres; the building stays in normal use but detuned until occupants complain in the windy season; adding antifreeze without recomputing density and viscosity also shifts frequency and damping away from the test baseline. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：水槽兼作消防水源時，火災後若未補足抽用的水，阻尼器會長期脫調。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: When the tanks double as fire storage, failing to refill after a fire draw-down leaves the damper detuned for a long time.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水槽裡的水只要沒有漏光，阻尼器性能就不會改變。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"As long as the tank does not run dry, the damper's performance does not change.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"補水閥故障或水位計漂移時，水位慢慢下降數公分，建築照常使用卻已脫調，直到強風季住戶抱怨才被發現；加入防凍液而未重算密度與黏性，也會讓頻率與阻尼偏離試驗基準。","textEn":"A failed fill valve or drifting gauge lets the level fall a few centimetres; the building stays in normal use but detuned until occupants complain in the windy season; adding antifreeze without recomputing density and viscosity also shifts frequency and damping away from the test baseline.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「蒸發、水質與防凍」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Evaporation, water quality and freeze protection\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補水閥故障或水位計漂移時，水位慢慢下降數公分，建築照常使用卻已脫調，直到強風季住戶抱怨才被發現；加入防凍液而未重算密度與黏性，也會讓頻率與阻尼偏離試驗基準。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。"],"optionsEn":["A failed fill valve or drifting gauge lets the level fall a few centimetres.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake."],"answer":0,"explanation":"補水閥故障或水位計漂移時，水位慢慢下降數公分，建築照常使用卻已脫調，直到強風季住戶抱怨才被發現；加入防凍液而未重算密度與黏性，也會讓頻率與阻尼偏離試驗基準。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A failed fill valve or drifting gauge lets the level fall a few centimetres; the building stays in normal use but detuned until occupants complain in the windy season; adding antifreeze without recomputing density and viscosity also shifts frequency and damping away from the test baseline. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b067-v13-37","title":"極端事件、出水高度與交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Extreme events, freeboard and handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「出水高度與槽頂」如何影響液態調諧阻尼器的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Freeboard and tank roof” governs force, deformation or durability in “Tuned liquid dampers”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"颱風或地震時，水面振幅可能遠超過舒適度設計振幅，水面撞擊槽頂會產生衝擊壓力，濺出的水則造成屋頂積水與水量流失。設計須在兩種策略中擇一：保留足夠出水高度讓水自由晃動，或把槽頂設計成承受衝擊的結構。地震時 TLD 也會把晃動動壓傳回結構，須納入屋頂構件設計；事件後的檢查與交接文件，決定阻尼器能否迅速回到調頻狀態。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「出水高度與槽頂」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"In a typhoon or earthquake the surface excursion can far exceed the comfort-design amplitude; water striking the tank roof produces impact pressure, and spillage floods the roof and loses water. Design must adopt one of two strategies: enough freeboard for free sloshing, or a tank roof designed for impact. In an earthquake the TLD also returns sloshing pressure to the structure, which must be included in roof member design; post-event inspection and handover documents decide whether the damper can quickly return to its tuned state. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Freeboard and tank roof” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：以線性化估計 η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g)。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A linearised estimate is η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g).","failure":"常見誤解：「水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「出水高度與槽頂」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Freeboard and tank roof”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-37-k1","title":"極端事件、出水高度與交接","titleEn":"Extreme events, freeboard and handover","text":"颱風或地震時，水面振幅可能遠超過舒適度設計振幅，水面撞擊槽頂會產生衝擊壓力，濺出的水則造成屋頂積水與水量流失。設計須在兩種策略中擇一：保留足夠出水高度讓水自由晃動，或把槽頂設計成承受衝擊的結構。","textEn":"In a typhoon or earthquake the surface excursion can far exceed the comfort-design amplitude; water striking the tank roof produces impact pressure, and spillage floods the roof and loses water. Design must adopt one of two strategies: enough freeboard for free sloshing, or a tank roof designed for impact.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「極端事件、出水高度與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Extreme events, freeboard and handover\" is correct?","options":["水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。","颱風或地震時，水面振幅可能遠超過舒適度設計振幅，水面撞擊槽頂會產生衝擊壓力，濺出的水則造成屋頂積水與水量流失。","水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。"],"optionsEn":["Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake.","In a typhoon or earthquake the surface excursion can far exceed the comfort-design amplitude.","All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass."],"answer":1,"explanation":"颱風或地震時，水面振幅可能遠超過舒適度設計振幅，水面撞擊槽頂會產生衝擊壓力，濺出的水則造成屋頂積水與水量流失。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"In a typhoon or earthquake the surface excursion can far exceed the comfort-design amplitude; water striking the tank roof produces impact pressure, and spillage floods the roof and loses water. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b067-v13-38","title":"極端事件、出水高度與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Extreme events, freeboard and handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「出水高度與槽頂」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Freeboard and tank roof” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：以線性化估計 η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g)。槽長 L = 6.0 m、晃動頻率處的樓頂譜加速度 S_a = 0.15 g 時，η ≈ 3.0×0.15 = 0.45 m；水深 0.60 m 時槽內淨高至少約 1.05 m，若只做到 0.90 m，槽頂須按衝擊壓力設計。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A linearised estimate is η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g). For L = 6.0 m and a roof spectral acceleration S_a = 0.15 g at the sloshing frequency, η ≈ 3.0×0.15 = 0.45 m; with 0.60 m of water the internal height should be at least about 1.05 m, and if only 0.90 m is provided the tank roof must be designed for impact pressure. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以非線性時間歷程或計算流體力學檢查設計颱風與地震下的最大波高、衝擊次數與槽壁動壓，並複核屋頂構件；事件後依檢查表查看溢水痕跡、阻尼網變形、水位與水質，並以監測資料重新確認頻率比。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check maximum wave height, impact count and dynamic wall pressure under design typhoon and earthquake records with nonlinear time-history analysis or computational fluid dynamics, and verify the roof members; after an event, follow a checklist for spill marks, screen deformation, water level and quality, and reconfirm the frequency ratio from monitoring data.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"以線性化估計 η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g)。槽長 L = 6.0 m、晃動頻率處的樓頂譜加速度 S_a = 0.15 g 時，η ≈ 3.0×0.15 = 0.45 m；水深 0.60 m 時槽內淨高至少約 1.05 m，若只做到 0.90 m，槽頂須按衝擊壓力設計。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"A linearised estimate is η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g). For L = 6.0 m and a roof spectral acceleration S_a = 0.15 g at the sloshing frequency, η ≈ 3.0×0.15 = 0.45 m; with 0.60 m of water the internal height should be at least about 1.05 m, and if only 0.90 m is provided the tank roof must be designed for impact pressure. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「極端事件、出水高度與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Extreme events, freeboard and handover\", which statement holds?","options":["U 形液柱阻尼器的頻率可以靠加寬水平段來調整。","水槽只是裝水的容器，不需要當成結構構件設計。","以線性化估計 η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g)。"],"optionsEn":["The frequency of a U-tube damper can be tuned by widening the horizontal leg.","A tank is just a water container and need not be designed as a structural member.","A linearised estimate is η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g)."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以線性化估計 η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g)。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A linearised estimate is η ≈ (L/2)·(S_a/g). Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b067-v13-39","title":"極端事件、出水高度與交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Extreme events, freeboard and handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「出水高度與槽頂」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Freeboard and tank roof” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以非線性時間歷程或計算流體力學檢查設計颱風與地震下的最大波高、衝擊次數與槽壁動壓，並複核屋頂構件；事件後依檢查表查看溢水痕跡、阻尼網變形、水位與水質，並以監測資料重新確認頻率比。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check maximum wave height, impact count and dynamic wall pressure under design typhoon and earthquake records with nonlinear time-history analysis or computational fluid dynamics, and verify the roof members; after an event, follow a checklist for spill marks, screen deformation, water level and quality, and reconfirm the frequency ratio from monitoring data. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接文件應包含每槽尺寸、調頻水位、阻尼網規格、試驗與監測基準、事件後檢查表與補水程序；建築改裝若改變屋頂設備重量或核心勁度，須由結構顧問重新評估調頻並核可。","observationEn":"Site practice: Handover documents should include each tank's dimensions, tuning level, screen specification, test and monitoring baselines, the post-event checklist and refilling procedure; renovations that change roof equipment weight or core stiffness require the structural consultant to reassess and approve the tuning.","failure":"注意干擾：出水高度不足而槽頂又按一般屋頂設計時，強震中的衝擊壓力可能破壞槽頂或接縫，大量溢水流入下方樓層；事件後若未補水重調，阻尼器到下一個颱風季仍處於脫調狀態。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: With too little freeboard and a tank roof designed as an ordinary roof, impact pressure in a strong earthquake can break the roof or joints and spill large volumes into the floors below; without refilling and retuning afterwards, the damper stays detuned into the next typhoon season. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以非線性時間歷程或計算流體力學檢查設計颱風與地震下的最大波高、衝擊次數與槽壁動壓，並複核屋頂構件；事件後依檢查表查看溢水痕跡、阻尼網變形、水位與水質，並以監測資料重新確認頻率比。","textEn":"Check maximum wave height, impact count and dynamic wall pressure under design typhoon and earthquake records with nonlinear time-history analysis or computational fluid dynamics, and verify the roof members; after an event, follow a checklist for spill marks, screen deformation, water level and quality, and reconfirm the frequency ratio from monitoring data.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接文件應包含每槽尺寸、調頻水位、阻尼網規格、試驗與監測基準、事件後檢查表與補水程序；建築改裝若改變屋頂設備重量或核心勁度，須由結構顧問重新評估調頻並核可。","textEn":"Handover documents should include each tank's dimensions, tuning level, screen specification, test and monitoring baselines, the post-event checklist and refilling procedure; renovations that change roof equipment weight or core stiffness require the structural consultant to reassess and approve the tuning.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「極端事件、出水高度與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Extreme events, freeboard and handover\"?","options":["以非線性時間歷程或計算流體力學檢查設計颱風與地震下的最大波高、衝擊次數與槽壁動壓，並複核屋頂構件。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","縮尺模型的水深可以和實尺度相同，只要縮小平面尺寸即可。"],"optionsEn":["Check maximum wave height, impact count and dynamic wall pressure under design typhoon and earthquake records with nonlinear time-history analysis or computational fluid dynamics, and verify the roof members.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","A scaled model can keep the full-scale water depth and simply shrink the plan dimensions."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以非線性時間歷程或計算流體力學檢查設計颱風與地震下的最大波高、衝擊次數與槽壁動壓，並複核屋頂構件；事件後依檢查表查看溢水痕跡、阻尼網變形、水位與水質，並以監測資料重新確認頻率比。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check maximum wave height, impact count and dynamic wall pressure under design typhoon and earthquake records with nonlinear time-history analysis or computational fluid dynamics, and verify the roof members; after an event, follow a checklist for spill marks, screen deformation, water level and quality, and reconfirm the frequency ratio from monitoring data. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b067-v13-40","title":"極端事件、出水高度與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Extreme events, freeboard and handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"prerequisiteIds":["b067-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「出水高度與槽頂」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Freeboard and tank roof” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"出水高度不足而槽頂又按一般屋頂設計時，強震中的衝擊壓力可能破壞槽頂或接縫，大量溢水流入下方樓層；事件後若未補水重調，阻尼器到下一個颱風季仍處於脫調狀態。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"With too little freeboard and a tank roof designed as an ordinary roof, impact pressure in a strong earthquake can break the roof or joints and spill large volumes into the floors below; without refilling and retuning afterwards, the damper stays detuned into the next typhoon season. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：地震時 TLD 也會把晃動動壓傳回結構，須納入屋頂構件設計；事件後的檢查與交接文件，決定阻尼器能否迅速回到調頻狀態。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: In an earthquake the TLD also returns sloshing pressure to the structure, which must be included in roof member design; post-event inspection and handover documents decide whether the damper can quickly return to its tuned state.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水槽只在強風時晃動，地震時不會對結構產生額外的力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Tanks slosh only in strong wind and add no force to the structure in an earthquake.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b067-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"出水高度不足而槽頂又按一般屋頂設計時，強震中的衝擊壓力可能破壞槽頂或接縫，大量溢水流入下方樓層；事件後若未補水重調，阻尼器到下一個颱風季仍處於脫調狀態。","textEn":"With too little freeboard and a tank roof designed as an ordinary roof, impact pressure in a strong earthquake can break the roof or joints and spill large volumes into the floors below; without refilling and retuning afterwards, the damper stays detuned into the next typhoon season.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]},{"id":"b067-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「極端事件、出水高度與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Extreme events, freeboard and handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","出水高度不足而槽頂又按一般屋頂設計時，強震中的衝擊壓力可能破壞槽頂或接縫，大量溢水流入下方樓層；事件後若未補水重調，阻尼器到下一個颱風季仍處於脫調狀態。","水槽裡的水全部都參與減振，所以水量就等於阻尼器質量。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","With too little freeboard and a tank roof designed as an ordinary roof, impact pressure in a strong earthquake can break the roof or joints and spill large volumes into the floors below.","All the water in the tank takes part in damping, so the water mass equals the damper mass."],"answer":1,"explanation":"出水高度不足而槽頂又按一般屋頂設計時，強震中的衝擊壓力可能破壞槽頂或接縫，大量溢水流入下方樓層；事件後若未補水重調，阻尼器到下一個颱風季仍處於脫調狀態。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"With too little freeboard and a tank roof designed as an ordinary roof, impact pressure in a strong earthquake can break the roof or joints and spill large volumes into the floors below; without refilling and retuning afterwards, the damper stays detuned into the next typhoon season. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-rwdi-comcast-center","v13s-glotman-one-wall-centre","v13s-nathaz-liquid-dampers","v13s-cce-one-wall-centre","v13s-bdc-one-rincon-hill"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
